1
00:01:02,475 --> 00:01:10,703
倩女幽魂 第2集:人间道

2
00:01:12,166 --> 00:01:16,098
十里平湖霜满天
Frost fills the sky over Ten Mile Lake

3
00:01:16,299 --> 00:01:20,061
寸寸青丝愁华年
Silken threads anxious of youth

4
00:01:20,266 --> 00:01:23,664
对月形单望相护
Looking at the moon and feeling lonely

5
00:01:23,866 --> 00:01:26,957
只羡鸳鸯不羡仙
Envious of love, not of immortality

6
00:01:27,166 --> 00:01:28,063
宁采臣
This pointing

7
00:01:28,266 --> 00:01:31,630
你见到这幅画就好似见我一样
will remind you of me

8
00:01:31,932 --> 00:01:35,558
聂小倩之墓？
Hsiao-tsing's grave?!

9
00:01:35,867 --> 00:01:38,833
现在你相信小倩死了很久啦
Hsiao-tsing died long ago

10
00:01:39,032 --> 00:01:41,658
小倩是鬼？
She's ghost?!

11
00:01:42,999 --> 00:01:48,091
没错，我是鬼，但是我不想害人
Yes! I'm a ghost but I bring mortals no harm

12
00:01:48,466 --> 00:01:49,900
当年，我客、死异乡
I died far away from my home

13
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:52,867
尸骨让千年树妖缠着不放
An evil spirit took by corpse and won't let me rest in peace

14
00:01:52,867 --> 00:01:56,196
如果你肯救我的话
If you want to save me

15
00:01:56,566 --> 00:01:57,896
就将我的尸骨搬走
move my bones away from here

16
00:01:58,099 --> 00:01:59,962
那我就可以投胎转世
Then it will be possible for me to be reincarnated

17
00:02:01,233 --> 00:02:02,833
小倩！
Hsiao-tsing!

18
00:02:02,833 --> 00:02:04,957
我一定会救你！
I will save you

19
00:02:10,099 --> 00:02:11,588
小倩！
Hsiao-tsing!

20
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,766
宁采臣！
Ning!

21
00:02:17,132 --> 00:02:19,860
和我作对？我要你永不超生！
You dare oppose me?! I will never excuse you from death!

22
00:02:22,032 --> 00:02:23,760
你放过他们！
Let them go, please

23
00:02:27,166 --> 00:02:31,758
金刚经？呀…！
The Diamond Sutra!

24
00:02:36,633 --> 00:02:38,724
走脱了，小倩，我们安全了！
We've escaped! Hsiao-tsing, we're safe!

25
00:02:39,233 --> 00:02:40,994
天光了
Dawn is breaking

26
00:02:41,766 --> 00:02:44,095
小倩，你快躲进骨灰盅里边去
Hsiao-tsing, hide in the tower of ashes

27
00:02:44,466 --> 00:02:45,557
不要让阳光射到
If the sun's rays shine on you

28
00:02:45,766 --> 00:02:47,856
不然的话，你不能投胎啦！
you'll never be reincarnated

29
00:02:48,866 --> 00:02:51,162
宁采臣，永别！
Ning, good-bye forever!

30
00:03:07,066 --> 00:03:08,895
希望小倩可以投胎做人
I hope that Hsiao-tsing will be reincarnated

31
00:03:09,099 --> 00:03:12,395
我要回兰若寺，避开尘世
I must return to the Orchid Temple

32
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:15,895
有事就去兰若寺找我，珍重！
If you need me, you can find me there Take care!

33
00:04:39,999 --> 00:04:41,625
那个年轻人是谁？
Who is that young man!

34
00:04:41,832 --> 00:04:44,094
他就是后面街的那个穷书生
He's the poor scholar who lived two blocks away

35
00:04:44,466 --> 00:04:47,523
他现在才回来，这个世界都变啦
Things have changed since he was last here

36
00:05:03,799 --> 00:05:07,129
他不就是集宝斋派来收帐的那个小子
Wasn't he that shop's bill collector?

37
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:10,988
集宝斋已关门很久啦，他还懵然不知
He doesn't even know it went out of business long ago!

38
00:05:22,966 --> 00:05:24,898
招待不周，招待不周
Welcome! Welcome!

39
00:05:57,099 --> 00:05:58,826
收帐来了
The bill collector's here

40
00:05:59,099 --> 00:06:00,758
收了多少啦？
How much money did you collect?

41
00:06:01,099 --> 00:06:02,395
我们是捉逃犯的
We're here to catch escaped convicts

42
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,031
衙差！走…！
It's the police! Run!

43
00:06:04,233 --> 00:06:05,755
追！
Pursue them!

44
00:06:08,866 --> 00:06:09,923
你是不是周亚炳？
You're Bing Chow?!

45
00:06:10,132 --> 00:06:10,832
这个好明显
You made a mistake

46
00:06:10,832 --> 00:06:13,060
他有须我没有，我是好人呀！
He has a beard and I don't!

47
00:06:13,433 --> 00:06:14,659
没须？剃了不就没有了
You shaved it off!

48
00:06:14,866 --> 00:06:15,854
捉他回去领奖金
Take him back and collect the reward

49
00:06:16,066 --> 00:06:17,464
进去！
Get in!

50
00:06:18,099 --> 00:06:20,190
你们冤枉我，我没有犯法
I haven't committed any crime!

51
00:06:20,566 --> 00:06:22,724
放我出去，冤枉呀！
Let me go I've been wrongly accused!

52
00:06:22,932 --> 00:06:25,057
放我出去，冤枉呀！
Let me go I've been wrongly accused!

53
00:06:25,433 --> 00:06:28,796
放我出去，我不是周亚炳，冤枉呀！
You made a mistake I'm not Bing Chow!

54
00:06:28,932 --> 00:06:30,955
冤枉呀！
I am wrongly accused!

55
00:06:45,699 --> 00:06:47,097
我叫宁采臣，不是周亚炳
My name is Ning, not Bing Chow

56
00:06:47,466 --> 00:06:48,090
老伯，请问你…
Old man may I ask who...

57
00:06:50,632 --> 00:06:55,088
我和你一样，是人，命中注定要坐监
A man, just like you, fated to being imprisoned

58
00:06:55,466 --> 00:06:56,832
这么悲观！
So pessimistic!

59
00:06:56,832 --> 00:07:00,094
这都怪祖先无眼，叫我追求学问
It's all me elders' fault, insisting I get an education

60
00:07:00,466 --> 00:07:02,761
等我长大了，写书做博学士
When I grew up, I was learned and wrote backs

61
00:07:03,466 --> 00:07:04,489
谁知道写游记
But when I write of my travels

62
00:07:04,699 --> 00:07:06,631
被人说我泄漏国家机密
I'm accused of revealing state secrets

63
00:07:06,832 --> 00:07:09,094
写历史，说我借古讽今
When I write of history, they say I'm satirizing the present

64
00:07:09,466 --> 00:07:12,523
好，那去注解兵法，又说我煽动作反
If I analyze military strategy, they say I'm planning a rebellion

65
00:07:12,732 --> 00:07:13,925
唉！写神话好了吧
I can't even write fairy tales

66
00:07:14,132 --> 00:07:16,428
却又说我导人迷信
for they accuse me of promoting superstition

67
00:07:16,799 --> 00:07:18,924
最后唯有替人写传记
Finally, I wrote the biography of a powerful man

68
00:07:19,132 --> 00:07:21,859
结果那个人被抓了，说是乱党
Then he was arrested, accused of being a rebel

69
00:07:22,066 --> 00:07:23,929
我跟他一起被判终身监禁
We were both sentenced to life imprisonment

70
00:07:24,132 --> 00:07:27,825
你说是不是命里注定要坐牢呢？
Wouldn't you say that prison is my fate?

71
00:07:29,999 --> 00:07:30,866
蟑螂呀！
A cockroach!

72
00:07:30,866 --> 00:07:32,661
哪里，哪里…
Where?

73
00:07:32,866 --> 00:07:33,889
蟑螂？
Cockroach?!

74
00:07:37,732 --> 00:07:40,994
你真浪费呀，蟑螂在这里是极品呀
You're really wasteful! The cockroaches here are of the best quality

75
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:42,899
这里没有山珍海味
There are no delicacies here

76
00:07:42,899 --> 00:07:43,832
你多住一阵子
After you're been here a while

77
00:07:43,832 --> 00:07:45,764
就会看到苍蝇都流口水了
you'll even salivate ever a housefly

78
00:07:46,699 --> 00:07:48,562
老伯，你在这里困了多久？
Old man, how long have your been here?

79
00:07:48,799 --> 00:07:50,788
刚来的时候，就像你一样
I was your age when I first arrived

80
00:07:50,999 --> 00:07:54,658
现在变成我这样，你看多有性格！
Look how I've changed! Full of character!

81
00:07:54,899 --> 00:07:56,388
那就是说坐了很久了
You've been here a long time!

82
00:07:56,599 --> 00:07:59,191
救命呀！救命呀！冤枉呀！
Help! I am innocent!

83
00:07:59,565 --> 00:08:02,895
我不是周亚炳，冤枉呀！
I'm not Bing Chow! I am innocent!

84
00:08:03,166 --> 00:08:05,859
冤枉呀，我不是周亚炳呀！
You've made a mistake I'm not Bing Chow!

85
00:08:36,699 --> 00:08:40,899
又发恶梦了，今次又梦见什么啦？
Another nightmare What did you dream this time?

86
00:08:40,899 --> 00:08:42,058
我梦见你筋疲力尽的
I dreamt you were haggard and exhausted

87
00:08:42,433 --> 00:08:43,160
筋疲力尽？
Exhausted?!

88
00:08:43,532 --> 00:08:45,589
对呀，你就快会筋疲力尽了
True, you will soon be totally exhausted

89
00:08:45,866 --> 00:08:48,889
晚晚发恶梦，你看看墙上的日历
You have nightmares every night Look at the calendar

90
00:08:49,099 --> 00:08:51,463
你进来了这么久还不适应
You've been here so long and still can't adjust

91
00:08:51,665 --> 00:08:53,790
再过一阵子你连自己姓周都记不起了
Soon you'll even forget that your last name is Chow

92
00:08:53,966 --> 00:08:55,864
老伯，我不是姓周的
Old man, my last name isn't Chow!

93
00:08:56,932 --> 00:08:58,488
周亚炳！
Bing Chow!

94
00:09:00,066 --> 00:09:01,054
吃饭喇！
Supper!

95
00:09:01,433 --> 00:09:03,456
好呀，好呀！
OK

96
00:09:07,466 --> 00:09:09,899
鸡腿！鸡腿！
A chicken leg?!

97
00:09:09,899 --> 00:09:12,865
啊，运气来了！
Happy days are here again!

98
00:09:14,632 --> 00:09:17,064
老伯，只有一碗，你先吃吧！
Old man! There's only one bowl You eat first

99
00:09:17,433 --> 00:09:19,921
你自己吃吧，我宁愿吃蟑螂
No, it's for you I'd rather eat cockroaches

100
00:09:20,732 --> 00:09:22,062
吃完了再告诉你吧！
I'll tell you something when you've finished

101
00:09:22,433 --> 00:09:24,160
我好久没吃鸡了
I haven't had chicken in a long time

102
00:09:24,632 --> 00:09:27,394
怎么你涂了我的名字呢？老伯！
Old man, why are you carving my name?

103
00:09:27,599 --> 00:09:29,832
告诉你，墙上有名之人
All these men

104
00:09:29,832 --> 00:09:31,389
每一个都吃过鸡腿
ate chicken legs

105
00:09:31,599 --> 00:09:34,031
这只鸡叫做夺命鸡
We call that chicken a headless chicken

106
00:09:34,565 --> 00:09:37,463
吃过了就要被抓上刑场去砍头的
After you've eaten it, they chop off your head!

107
00:09:37,732 --> 00:09:39,891
砍头？
Chop off your head?!

108
00:09:45,632 --> 00:09:49,758
周亚炳，周亚炳，钱财送上黄泉路
Bing Chow, we have no personal quarrel

109
00:09:49,966 --> 00:09:52,023
有仇不要找我报
Don't come back from the grave and seek revenge on me!

110
00:09:54,665 --> 00:09:56,722
老伯，人家说午时斩首
They behead people at noon

111
00:09:56,932 --> 00:09:58,864
怎么会三更半夜行刑的呢？
It's now the middle of the night

112
00:09:59,532 --> 00:10:01,396
一定那些高官子弟犯了罪
Some official's son got in trouble

113
00:10:01,599 --> 00:10:03,190
找人做替死鬼
and they're looking for a substitute

114
00:10:03,565 --> 00:10:04,799
三更半夜的
At night

115
00:10:04,799 --> 00:10:07,856
随便斩那一个都没人知道
the executioner can't tell one from another

116
00:10:09,699 --> 00:10:11,756
世间上真的没有公理
Is there no justice in the world?

117
00:10:13,632 --> 00:10:19,122
原来做好人是没有好报的
Is there no reward for being a good man?

118
00:10:20,632 --> 00:10:32,464
不关我的事…
It is of no concern to me

119
00:10:37,099 --> 00:10:38,928
我做人向来两袖清风
I was always an honest man

120
00:10:39,132 --> 00:10:40,995
能送的我都送给你
I'll give you whatever I can

121
00:10:41,832 --> 00:10:44,855
这幅画是我一个亲人留给我
This painting was a gift from my dearest one

122
00:10:45,066 --> 00:10:46,759
我去那儿都带着它
I don't want to part with it even in death

123
00:10:47,432 --> 00:10:49,660
我没见过像你这么重感情的人
Young man, you have a good heart

124
00:10:49,866 --> 00:10:52,457
物轻情义重，我还个礼给你
Let me give you a present

125
00:10:54,632 --> 00:10:56,189
老伯，你这么好的学问
You are so learned

126
00:10:56,565 --> 00:10:57,929
幸亏只是找我做替死鬼
It is fortunate that I die rather than you

127
00:10:58,132 --> 00:10:59,961
你人这么好，死了太可惜了
You're a good man Such a pity you have to die

128
00:11:00,166 --> 00:11:01,832
我死不可惜，你死了才可惜
It would be a pity if you died, not me

129
00:11:01,832 --> 00:11:03,491
谁说的，那一个死都可惜
Anybody's death is a pity

130
00:11:03,699 --> 00:11:04,790
你这种人世上已经少有了
You're a rare specimen

131
00:11:04,999 --> 00:11:07,487
要是死了，那不就绝种了，不…
If you die, your type will be extinct

132
00:11:07,699 --> 00:11:08,995
我有好久没放生了
It's been a long time since I set somebody free

133
00:11:09,199 --> 00:11:11,832
这里有个地下通道，直通外面
This tunnel leads to the outside

134
00:11:11,832 --> 00:11:14,423
你到了外面，可以重头来过
Go out and start anew

135
00:11:16,899 --> 00:11:18,387
何必给假希望我呢
Don't give me such false hopes

136
00:11:18,599 --> 00:11:20,899
如果可以直通外面，你早就出去了
If this is an escape route, why didn't you escape long ago?

137
00:11:20,899 --> 00:11:23,092
我在这里写书，没有人来烦我
It's less troublesome for me to write my book here

138
00:11:23,465 --> 00:11:25,761
写完了又可以随时拿出去给人家印
When I finish, then I'll escape and get it printed

139
00:11:25,966 --> 00:11:27,761
你不用担心我的安危
Don't worry about me

140
00:11:28,199 --> 00:11:29,926
这个包袱你带在身边
Always keep this bundle with you

141
00:11:30,132 --> 00:11:33,495
年轻人，你出去了就不要再回来了
Once you're out of here never come back!

142
00:11:33,699 --> 00:11:36,165
走呀…走呀！
Get going!

143
00:11:36,899 --> 00:11:38,455
我走了你怎办？
What will happen to you after I've gone?

144
00:11:38,866 --> 00:11:40,093
他们喜欢听我讲故事
They like hearing my stories

145
00:11:40,465 --> 00:11:41,954
我的故事讲来讲去都讲不完
So long as I don't get to the story's end

146
00:11:42,166 --> 00:11:43,154
所以不会斩我的
They'll never harm me

147
00:11:43,532 --> 00:11:44,555
两个人少了一个，怎么过得了这关呢
But they'll accuse you of helping me escape

148
00:11:44,765 --> 00:11:46,697
我就说前两天
I'll say you were put to death

149
00:11:46,899 --> 00:11:48,387
被你们狱卒抓去做替死鬼了
for somebody else two days ago

150
00:11:48,599 --> 00:11:51,827
他们就不敢查了，放心走吧！
They won't dare make a fuse

151
00:11:52,066 --> 00:11:53,793
走呀！保重呀！
Go! Take care!

152
00:11:54,999 --> 00:11:58,487
周亚炳，时辰到了，准备上路吧
Bing Chow! The time has come!

153
00:11:58,699 --> 00:12:00,756
快点！…
Hurry up!

154
00:12:02,465 --> 00:12:03,124
周亚炳！
Bing Chow!

155
00:12:03,499 --> 00:12:04,760
死了！
He's dead

156
00:12:12,632 --> 00:12:16,394
重见天日了，真是险过剃头！
I've escaped!

157
00:12:30,699 --> 00:12:32,392
连坐骑都已准备好了
There's even a horse here waiting for me!

158
00:12:36,465 --> 00:12:37,761
老伯真是神通广大
That old man

159
00:12:37,966 --> 00:12:39,795
不知道是那位高人呢？
is really remarkable!

160
00:12:39,999 --> 00:12:41,965
改天要好好的报答他才行
I must reply his kindness someday

161
00:12:47,032 --> 00:12:49,089
喂，我的千里追呀…
Hey! That's my horse!

162
00:12:49,465 --> 00:12:52,590
喂，真是笨，那一个骑上去都跑
What a stupid horse! Letting a stranger ride him!

163
00:12:53,032 --> 00:12:54,827
害得我连洗手的时间都没有
I don't even have time to wash my hands!

164
00:12:58,233 --> 00:13:00,790
你有你在上面跑，我有我在下面追
You think you're fast over land I'll go underground!

165
00:13:01,532 --> 00:13:02,555
遁地！
Open sesame!

166
00:13:10,166 --> 00:13:11,859
这么大雨到那儿去避呢？
I must find a place to get out of this downpour!

167
00:13:15,799 --> 00:13:17,765
有人家了，先避一下
Good! A House!

168
00:13:20,799 --> 00:13:23,458
开门呀，开门呀！
Open the door!

169
00:13:31,866 --> 00:13:33,627
正气山庄
"Righteous Villa"

170
00:13:42,866 --> 00:13:44,923
有没有人呀？
Anybody home?

171
00:13:49,032 --> 00:13:54,055
一、二、三、四、五、六、七、八
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8

172
00:13:54,432 --> 00:13:56,762
八副棺材，那不是一家人全在这里
Eight Coffins! Must be the whole family

173
00:13:58,866 --> 00:14:02,798
我不会打扰你们的，我只是借宿一宵
I won't disturb you I just want to stay the night

174
00:14:03,565 --> 00:14:05,497
你们用不着起来招呼我
Don't bother to get up I'll take care of myself

175
00:14:08,565 --> 00:14:13,554
我说过不用招呼我了，请回吧！…
I told you not to go to any trouble. Please go back!

176
00:14:13,765 --> 00:14:15,856
回你的头呀
The way you rush about

177
00:14:16,532 --> 00:14:18,964
你在上面转来转去，四处跑
in no fixed direction!

178
00:14:19,165 --> 00:14:21,029
搞到我在下面团团转
I had a hard time following you underground

179
00:14:21,232 --> 00:14:23,755
你到那儿去没目标吗？
Don't you have any idea where you're going?

180
00:14:24,465 --> 00:14:26,761
你面色这么难看，一定是死得很惨
Your face looks so horrible, you must have suffered a painful death

181
00:14:27,099 --> 00:14:29,792
如果你像我那样在下面追了一整天
If you'd rushed around underground all day like me

182
00:14:29,999 --> 00:14:32,157
你就是不死都上不来了
you wouldn't have the energy to come back to the surface

183
00:14:36,966 --> 00:14:38,864
我不认识你，你干吗跟着我？
I don't know you Why are you following me?

184
00:14:39,066 --> 00:14:41,657
我也不认识你，你为什么骑我的马？
I don't know you either so why did you take my horse?

185
00:14:42,932 --> 00:14:44,557
原来这只马是你的
That's your horse?

186
00:14:44,765 --> 00:14:46,697
我还以为这只马是老伯的
I thought it was the old man's

187
00:14:46,899 --> 00:14:48,866
老伯，老伯你也该问一声
Still you should have asked

188
00:14:48,866 --> 00:14:50,627
见马就骑
before taking it

189
00:14:50,799 --> 00:14:53,492
那你是人罗，对不起，是个误会
You're alive! Sorry! It's all a misunderstanding

190
00:14:56,966 --> 00:14:59,727
有什么要我帮忙的，你说好了
If there's anything I can do to help, just let me know

191
00:15:00,565 --> 00:15:04,020
还声东击西的暗算我，幸亏我反应快
Enough of your tricks! A good thing my reactions are so fast

192
00:15:04,966 --> 00:15:06,799
朋友，朋友，你也不过想借宿一宵
Friend, you need a place to stay the night

193
00:15:06,799 --> 00:15:08,628
这里有瓦遮头，就这里好了
Here there's a roof over your head Might as well stay here

194
00:15:09,131 --> 00:15:09,995
要是我睡着了
How do I know

195
00:15:10,198 --> 00:15:11,824
我怎么知道你做些什么？
what you'd do after I fell asleep?

196
00:15:16,832 --> 00:15:18,957
我早料到是外面漏水
I knew it!

197
00:15:19,165 --> 00:15:22,893
大家分清界线，我在隔壁
Let's draw up some boundaries I'm staying next door

198
00:15:23,098 --> 00:15:26,065
有什么话大声讲，不要过来找我
If you have something to say, shout it! Don't come over

199
00:15:39,966 --> 00:15:42,057
我有好几个月没洗澡了
I haven't bathed in a long time

200
00:17:45,998 --> 00:17:47,794
什么人？
Who is it?

201
00:17:51,765 --> 00:17:52,957
是不是人呀？
Are you a mortal?

202
00:17:56,565 --> 00:17:58,690
隔壁的朋友，快点起来呀
Hey, friend next door!

203
00:17:58,899 --> 00:17:59,830
这里有鬼呀
Get up! There's ghosts!

204
00:18:00,031 --> 00:18:02,020
快点起来，听见了没有？
Get up! Do you hear me?

205
00:18:02,232 --> 00:18:03,892
快点起来呀！
Hurry and get up!

206
00:18:04,098 --> 00:18:05,792
一声不响的，一定是走了
Not a sound Maybe he left already

207
00:18:26,065 --> 00:18:28,122
真的这么凶，无孔不入
What a nuisance!

208
00:18:44,198 --> 00:18:45,789
朋友，很猛的鬼呀，快点走呀！
Friend, there are fierce ghosts here!

209
00:18:45,998 --> 00:18:48,964
鬼？天地法灵，逐鬼驱魔令
Ghosts? I'll use my magic to banish them!

210
00:18:53,499 --> 00:18:57,864
站过一旁去，天地法灵，逐鬼驱魔令
Ghosts and goblins I order you to leave!

211
00:19:02,732 --> 00:19:05,789
老兄，原来你懂法术的
Oh, you understand the occult!

212
00:19:06,699 --> 00:19:08,631
我鼻子是专闻妖魔鬼怪的
My nose is sensitive to other worldly spirits...

213
00:19:08,832 --> 00:19:10,457
怎么一点味道都没有？
So why do I smell nothing now?

214
00:19:11,465 --> 00:19:12,089
避开！
Get out of the way!

215
00:19:14,699 --> 00:19:15,722
金锣脱锁！
Abracadabra!

216
00:19:18,432 --> 00:19:20,796
你们算什么鬼呀，一点鬼味都没有
Strange! Not even a hint of ghostly odor!

217
00:19:21,232 --> 00:19:23,790
叭呢叭呢吽，风火雷电霝
Abracadabra! Hocus-pocus flash!

218
00:19:42,665 --> 00:19:43,790
正飞过来，走！
They're coming Leave!

219
00:20:00,031 --> 00:20:01,691
搞了半天，原来是假的
You're not even real ghosts!

220
00:20:01,898 --> 00:20:02,762
浪费了我的法术
Wasting my occult talents!

221
00:20:02,965 --> 00:20:04,192
假的？
Phonies?

222
00:20:19,599 --> 00:20:20,462
走后门！
Want to trick me?

223
00:20:27,732 --> 00:20:29,061
幸好有你的腰带
A good thing you have a waistband

224
00:20:41,031 --> 00:20:43,156
不要过来呀，我不客、气了
Stay away from me!

225
00:20:44,931 --> 00:20:47,056
掉了…
I'm falling...

226
00:20:47,432 --> 00:20:50,193
不要接着我，不要接着我
Stop hugging me!

227
00:20:52,765 --> 00:20:53,560
放手呀！
Let go!

228
00:20:53,764 --> 00:20:54,787
放手我就要掉下去了
If I let go, I'll fall!

229
00:20:54,998 --> 00:20:57,964
再不放手，我…
If you don't let go, I'll...

230
00:21:26,931 --> 00:21:27,954
小倩？
Hsiao-tsing?!

231
00:21:30,764 --> 00:21:31,855
小倩！
Hsiao-tsing?!

232
00:21:36,565 --> 00:21:42,498
神兵火急，急急如律令，替我定！
Hocus-pocus heebie-jeebie! I order you to freeze!

233
00:21:43,965 --> 00:21:45,522
定！
Freeze!

234
00:21:45,731 --> 00:21:47,061
定！
Freeze!

235
00:21:47,432 --> 00:21:48,798
我定！
Freeze!

236
00:21:48,798 --> 00:21:50,492
小倩，是你呀？
Hsiao-tsing, is that you?

237
00:21:51,831 --> 00:21:54,024
你这是什么妖术，放了他们
What kind of black magic is that? Let them go!

238
00:21:54,232 --> 00:21:55,198
要不然我杀了他
Otherwise I'll kill him

239
00:21:55,565 --> 00:21:56,894
啊…我定！
Oh... Freeze!

240
00:21:59,065 --> 00:22:01,623
好，请动手，我根本不认识他
Kill him! He's no friend of mine!

241
00:22:04,898 --> 00:22:06,125
诸葛卧龙！
Elder Chu Kot!

242
00:22:07,798 --> 00:22:09,787
先生，你就是诸葛卧龙老前辈？
Chu Kot?! Are you Elder Chu Kot traveling incognito?

243
00:22:09,998 --> 00:22:11,464
诸葛什么？
Elder who?

244
00:22:11,665 --> 00:22:13,631
晚辈失礼了
Your disciple is deeply sorry

245
00:22:14,131 --> 00:22:15,721
晚辈？
Disciple?!

246
00:22:16,632 --> 00:22:17,995
诸葛卧龙？
Elder Chu Kot?!

247
00:22:18,764 --> 00:22:22,561
小倩，是我呀，你不认得我了？
Hsiao-tsing, it's me! Don't you recognize me?

248
00:22:23,764 --> 00:22:25,889
我们是忠良之后，本人是傅青风
We come from a good family My name is Windy

249
00:22:26,098 --> 00:22:27,655
她是舍妹傅月池
This is my younger sister, Moon

250
00:22:27,865 --> 00:22:29,728
诸葛前辈！
Elder Chu Kot

251
00:22:29,931 --> 00:22:31,591
前辈，见到你我们就有救了
Elder, you can save us

252
00:22:31,798 --> 00:22:33,730
我爹是前任礼部尚书傅天仇
My father is Lord Fu the ex-Minister of Rites

253
00:22:33,931 --> 00:22:36,420
被朝廷奸人所害，要押解上京处斩
He was framed. They're now transporting him to be executed

254
00:22:36,632 --> 00:22:38,790
我们想在半路上救回我爹
We want to attack the transport wagon and rescue him

255
00:22:39,831 --> 00:22:42,931
你是博学多才的诸葛卧龙
You are the learned and brilliant Chu Kot

256
00:22:42,931 --> 00:22:45,523
而你们两位是朝廷的忠臣义士
You two are loyal imperial warriors

257
00:22:45,731 --> 00:22:46,898
大家都是名人
Everyone is an eminent personage

258
00:22:46,898 --> 00:22:48,524
现在轮到我介绍我自己了
Now it's my turn to introduce myself

259
00:22:48,731 --> 00:22:52,391
我就是…解！
I am... Spell!

260
00:22:56,965 --> 00:22:57,794
失礼，失礼
My name is Autumn

261
00:22:57,998 --> 00:23:00,725
在下是昆仑派后学术士，知秋一叶
from the Kunlun sect

262
00:23:00,931 --> 00:23:02,898
前辈的大作我全都拜读过
I've read everything that the Elder has written

263
00:23:02,898 --> 00:23:04,798
我学法术只是对付那些妖魔
I only use my magic to battle demons

264
00:23:04,798 --> 00:23:06,560
国家大事我是不理的
I never get involved in affairs of state

265
00:23:07,131 --> 00:23:08,858
拜见诸葛前辈
We pay our respects to Elder Chu Kot

266
00:23:10,532 --> 00:23:13,656
我是宁采臣，不是诸葛卧龙呀
My name is Ning, not Chu Kot

267
00:23:13,931 --> 00:23:15,760
传闻前辈神龙见首不见尾
I can tell you are clever

268
00:23:15,965 --> 00:23:17,898
不会随便暴露自己的身份
Clever people do not always reveal their identities

269
00:23:17,898 --> 00:23:20,387
我们在心里记得前辈是那位就行了
Anyway, in our hearts we know who you really are

270
00:23:21,232 --> 00:23:23,164
我要怎么讲你才相信呢？
How can I make you believe me?

271
00:23:23,931 --> 00:23:25,658
不需要多说，大家记着
No need for you to say anything Everybody remember...

272
00:23:25,865 --> 00:23:26,694
由现在开始
From now on

273
00:23:26,898 --> 00:23:27,886
宁采臣就是诸葛卧龙
Elder Chu Kot will be known as Ning

274
00:23:28,098 --> 00:23:29,723
诸葛卧龙就是宁采臣
Chu Kot is Ning

275
00:23:29,931 --> 00:23:30,897
不错！
Yes!

276
00:23:32,831 --> 00:23:34,457
大家向天发誓
We will now take an oath

277
00:23:34,664 --> 00:23:36,597
谁要是把这个重要的秘密泄露出去
Whoever reveal their identities

278
00:23:36,798 --> 00:23:37,957
我们就将他碎尸万段
will be chopped up into 10,000 pieces

279
00:23:38,165 --> 00:23:39,858
是！
Yes!

280
00:23:40,865 --> 00:23:44,093
这马被你骑过，我都觉得很荣幸
Such an honour that you rode my horse!

281
00:23:50,898 --> 00:23:54,728
小倩，你还记得那幅画和诗吗？
Hsiao-tsing, do you remember this painting and poem?

282
00:23:55,499 --> 00:23:58,589
小倩？诗？
Hsiao-tsing? Poem?

283
00:23:58,798 --> 00:24:00,730
念诗了…快拿笔来
He's reciting poetry Quickly, pen and paper

284
00:24:00,931 --> 00:24:02,624
一人记一句，前辈有暗示啦
We must record what he says Elder is giving us a hint

285
00:24:02,831 --> 00:24:04,694
我有笔，快点！快点！
Hurry!

286
00:24:06,898 --> 00:24:09,524
十里平湖霜满天
Frost fills the sky over Ten Mile Lake;

287
00:24:09,731 --> 00:24:11,856
寸寸青丝愁华年
Silken threads anxious of youth

288
00:24:12,065 --> 00:24:14,931
对月形单望相护
Looking at the moon and feeling lonely

289
00:24:14,931 --> 00:24:17,988
只羡鸳鸯不羡仙
Envious of lovers, not of immortality

290
00:24:19,564 --> 00:24:20,860
真是深不可测
Very profound!

291
00:24:21,432 --> 00:24:23,556
什么十里呀？什么十里呀？
What does "ten mile" mean?

292
00:24:23,898 --> 00:24:26,830
十里？是什么意思？
Ten mile!

293
00:24:27,499 --> 00:24:29,623
高，果然真的高
It is all very deep

294
00:24:32,731 --> 00:24:34,493
前辈的意思太深奥啦
His words are too profound

295
00:24:37,165 --> 00:24:40,653
十里，十里，那就是十里亭了
Ten Mile? That must mean Ten Mile Pavilion

296
00:24:40,865 --> 00:24:41,422
怎样？
What do you mean?

297
00:24:41,631 --> 00:24:43,120
这里附近有个十里亭？
There's a Ten Mile Pavilion near hear

298
00:24:43,931 --> 00:24:48,865
对呀，姐姐…，十里就是十里亭
That's right! Sister, "ten mile' refers to Ten Mile Pavilion

299
00:24:48,865 --> 00:24:50,422
在附近！
It's nearby

300
00:24:52,598 --> 00:24:56,724
我明白了，这里不远有个十里亭
I understand Ten Mile Pavilion is not far from here

301
00:24:56,931 --> 00:24:59,692
霜满天那就是霜降
"Frost" refers to Frost's Descent

302
00:24:59,898 --> 00:25:01,455
一年有二十四个节气
Each year has 24 climatic periods...

303
00:25:01,664 --> 00:25:03,460
秋暑露秋寒霜降
After the autumnal equinox comes the frost...

304
00:25:03,664 --> 00:25:05,028
今天适逢霜降之日
and today is the day of Frost's Descent

305
00:25:05,232 --> 00:25:06,163
前辈的意思
Elder is telling us that

306
00:25:06,531 --> 00:25:07,861
是暗示我爹会被押经十里亭
father will be transported past Ten Mile Pavilion

307
00:25:08,065 --> 00:25:09,463
叫我们到那里去救他
He's telling us to rescue him there

308
00:25:09,664 --> 00:25:13,926
前辈真是神机妙算，我爹有救了
Elder is truly perceptive We can save father

309
00:25:15,232 --> 00:25:16,663
让我们猜中了
We had it right!

310
00:25:16,865 --> 00:25:17,853
好呀！
Good

311
00:25:18,065 --> 00:25:20,895
好痛呀！
It hurts!

312
00:25:21,198 --> 00:25:23,755
怎么样？快起来呀！…
What's the matter? Get up!

313
00:25:23,965 --> 00:25:25,397
探子报！
Reporting!

314
00:25:26,598 --> 00:25:27,655
青风姑娘
Miss Windy!

315
00:25:27,865 --> 00:25:29,922
傅大人将会在今晚被押经十里亭
Your father will pass the Ten Mile Pavilion tonight

316
00:25:30,131 --> 00:25:31,562
我们早就知道了
We already know that

317
00:25:32,564 --> 00:25:34,496
前辈真的有先见之明
Elder is truly brilliant!

318
00:25:35,965 --> 00:25:36,988
不过，前辈
But what about the rest of the poem?

319
00:25:37,198 --> 00:25:38,823
还剩下的两句诗又暗示什么呢
What do those two stanzas mean?

320
00:25:39,031 --> 00:25:40,019
是三句呀！
Three stanzas

321
00:25:40,232 --> 00:25:41,527
现在暗示什么都没用了
The meaning doesn't matter now

322
00:25:41,731 --> 00:25:43,391
你们要怎么想就怎么想好了
Interpret it in any way you desire

323
00:25:43,598 --> 00:25:45,689
明白，就是说做人要有主见
He means that we should have our own views...

324
00:25:45,898 --> 00:25:47,557
不要只听人家的，是不是这个意思？
not just listen to what other people say, right?

325
00:25:47,764 --> 00:25:49,196
那听前辈的算不算听人家呢？
So, should we still listen to what Elder says?

326
00:25:49,564 --> 00:25:50,087
这怎么相同呢？
Not only listen

327
00:25:50,465 --> 00:25:51,896
前辈的说话要记住，不断、揣摩
but take notes and ponder his meaning

328
00:25:52,098 --> 00:25:53,825
将来开枝散叶，代代相传
We must pass his wisdom on to future generations

329
00:25:54,031 --> 00:25:54,826
是！
Right!

330
00:25:55,031 --> 00:25:57,088
前辈，告辞了！
Time to leave!

331
00:25:57,464 --> 00:25:58,828
我送你们出去
Good-bye

332
00:25:59,065 --> 00:25:59,962
我们出发往十里亭！
We're off to Ten Mile Pavilion

333
00:26:00,165 --> 00:26:01,721
是，出发往十里亭！
Yes. We're off to Ten Mile Pavilion

334
00:26:02,098 --> 00:26:07,496
青风姑娘，小倩的画还给我
Miss Windy, please return Hsiao-tsing's painting to me

335
00:26:07,698 --> 00:26:09,028
是，前辈
Yes, Elder

336
00:26:11,798 --> 00:26:15,060
你叫我小倩，是不是暗示我用假名字
When you call me Hsiao-tsing, is that a hint that I need a pseudonym?

337
00:26:15,432 --> 00:26:17,693
那你以后叫我小倩好了
From now on, my name is Hsiao-tsing

338
00:26:24,065 --> 00:26:26,792
就算小倩投胎转世
If Hsiao-tsing were reincarnated

339
00:26:26,931 --> 00:26:29,090
现在只不过是个婴孩
she would now be a babe in arms

340
00:26:33,931 --> 00:26:35,829
她不是小倩！
She's not Hsiao-tsing!

341
00:26:57,965 --> 00:26:59,988
你在偷看什么？
What are you spying on?

342
00:27:00,698 --> 00:27:04,858
我…我…没什么
Me? Nothing

343
00:27:13,731 --> 00:27:15,890
姐姐，你也在偷看什么？
What are you spying on?

344
00:27:17,531 --> 00:27:20,691
我在看你刚才偷看的，看完了，出发
I wanted to see what you were spying on Time to go!

345
00:27:21,598 --> 00:27:23,831
姐姐，你猜你下个月嫁的那个马公子
Do you think your fiance, Prince Ma...

346
00:27:23,831 --> 00:27:25,456
有没有他那么潇洒？
is as handsome as Elder?

347
00:27:25,664 --> 00:27:26,823
我们是指腹为婚
We were betrothed before birth

348
00:27:27,031 --> 00:27:28,553
我怎知道他长得怎么样呢？
How do I know what he looks like?

349
00:27:28,764 --> 00:27:31,457
人家说有缘是不是这个意思？
Is that what people mean by fate?

350
00:27:31,798 --> 00:27:34,128
你在说谁跟谁？
Who are you referring to?

351
00:27:34,498 --> 00:27:37,623
没有，我只是觉得我好幸福
Oh, nobody It's just that I fell so fortunate

352
00:27:38,998 --> 00:27:41,896
幸福？我看你连口水都流出来了
Fortunate? You're frothing at the mouth!

353
00:28:08,831 --> 00:28:09,956
妖气！
Evil spirits!

354
00:28:18,131 --> 00:28:21,097
是手印还是脚印，好夸张呀
Is this a foot print or a hand print?

355
00:28:21,464 --> 00:28:23,055
找到那只妖怪不就知道了
We'll know when we find the monster

356
00:28:23,431 --> 00:28:24,692
不错！
Right!

357
00:28:29,464 --> 00:28:30,760
还害了人呢
It even harmed a man

358
00:28:31,664 --> 00:28:33,630
放在这里太可惜了，拿去给前辈看看
What a pity to leave it here Better show it to Elder

359
00:28:33,831 --> 00:28:35,456
好了…这里真的有鬼
OK!

360
00:28:35,664 --> 00:28:37,391
真的有鬼呀，前辈！
There really are ghosts in this place!

361
00:28:38,631 --> 00:28:38,858
是什么东西？
What is that?

362
00:28:39,065 --> 00:28:41,462
是死尸，是那只鬼把他害成这样
A corpse! It's all that ghost's fault

363
00:28:41,664 --> 00:28:42,994
你还抱着他，快放下吧！
Don't hug it. Put it down

364
00:28:45,564 --> 00:28:46,723
这个人怎么会死得这么惨？
How did this person die so pitifully?

365
00:28:46,931 --> 00:28:47,760
就是说这只鬼好凶
I'd say this an evil ghost

366
00:28:47,965 --> 00:28:50,090
那股气味好难闻罗
The odor is very strong

367
00:28:51,131 --> 00:28:52,391
来了！
It's back!

368
00:28:52,598 --> 00:28:53,757
是不是来找我们的？
Is it looking for us?

369
00:28:53,965 --> 00:28:55,624
快用你的法术呀
Use your "freeze" magic

370
00:28:55,865 --> 00:28:56,798
好！
Right!

371
00:28:56,798 --> 00:28:59,958
定心咒，神兵火急
I command you to freeze!

372
00:29:02,098 --> 00:29:07,758
急急如律令，这就行了！
Heebie-jeebie! Freeze! That'll stop him!

373
00:29:09,998 --> 00:29:11,520
这怎么用呢？
How do you do it?

374
00:29:11,731 --> 00:29:12,931
你看到那只鬼的时候
When you see a ghost

375
00:29:12,931 --> 00:29:14,897
就这样叫一声定
shout "freeze"

376
00:29:15,031 --> 00:29:22,898
就这样叫一声定，这就行了吗？喂
Like this? Freeze! Is that right? Hey!

377
00:29:22,898 --> 00:29:26,126
喂…，不好了，你的咒是怎样解的？
Oh, no! How do you lift the spell?

378
00:29:30,965 --> 00:29:32,430
要想个方法沟通一下才行
I have to think of a way to communicate with him

379
00:29:32,631 --> 00:29:34,063
没办法，让我试一试
What can I do? Let's try this...

380
00:29:34,431 --> 00:29:35,159
如果我做得对
If I'm right

381
00:29:35,531 --> 00:29:37,831
你的眼珠就上下转动
move your eyes up and down

382
00:29:37,831 --> 00:29:39,195
这就对了，好极了！
That's right! Fantastic!

383
00:29:39,564 --> 00:29:42,053
如果做得不对，眼珠就左右转
If I'm wrong, move them from left to right

384
00:29:42,431 --> 00:29:44,022
对，对！
Great!

385
00:29:44,731 --> 00:29:48,186
解咒的方法是一种手势
Will a hand gesture lift the spell?

386
00:29:59,165 --> 00:30:03,722
不是上下，又不是左右，歪的？…
What? Not up and down or left to right

387
00:30:03,931 --> 00:30:05,829
你不要玩了，好不好？
Don't joke with me

388
00:30:06,031 --> 00:30:08,088
等那只鬼来到就来不及了
If we wait too long, that monster will get us

389
00:30:08,464 --> 00:30:09,930
解咒在哪里？
Does lifting the spell

390
00:30:10,131 --> 00:30:12,426
是不是在胸口，让我看看
have to do with an acupuncture point?

391
00:30:13,231 --> 00:30:15,925
你的眼转得这么快，比走马灯还快呀
Your eyes are moving faster than a revolving lantern!

392
00:30:16,131 --> 00:30:17,188
我明白了
I understand!

393
00:30:17,564 --> 00:30:19,655
你想用激将法激我打动你是吗？
You're provoking me into hitting you

394
00:30:19,865 --> 00:30:23,898
好…那你就得捱一下了
OK. I'm going to hit you now

395
00:30:23,898 --> 00:30:25,887
我不迁就你的
Ready or not, here it comes!

396
00:30:36,931 --> 00:30:39,159
走呀！
Let's get out of here!

397
00:30:40,898 --> 00:30:42,420
走呀！
Come on!

398
00:30:45,498 --> 00:30:46,896
你好重呀
You're too heavy

399
00:30:53,065 --> 00:30:54,860
我抱不动了
I can't carry you

400
00:30:55,998 --> 00:30:57,623
拖吧
Drag it!

401
00:31:00,831 --> 00:31:01,931
拖也不够快
Dragging you isn't fast enough either

402
00:31:01,931 --> 00:31:03,863
好，我就把你藏到阁楼去
Better hide upstairs

403
00:31:15,164 --> 00:31:17,824
叫你不要玩了，玩成这样子
I told you not to fool around at a time like this

404
00:31:19,731 --> 00:31:22,993
那只鬼好高，一站高就看到我们了
That monster is so tall, it'll see us if he stands up straight

405
00:31:27,731 --> 00:31:30,561
老兄呀，你这个咒究竟怎么解呢
How can I undo the spell?

406
00:31:33,598 --> 00:31:34,757
怎么解？
How do I lift the spell?

407
00:31:35,598 --> 00:31:36,894
里边安全点，快躲进去
It's safer inside Better hide yourself quick

408
00:31:50,598 --> 00:31:51,798
我叫你躲进去嘛
I told you to hide inside

409
00:31:51,798 --> 00:31:54,696
为什么你走下去呢，下面这么危险
Why did you go down there, where it's so dangerous?

410
00:32:34,664 --> 00:32:39,187
定心咒，定！
Try the "freeze" curse! Freeze!

411
00:32:48,998 --> 00:32:50,896
来…我们继续撞吧！
Let's continue with out guessing game

412
00:32:53,731 --> 00:32:56,162
你越来越重，我快要扶不了你了
You're getting heavier and heavier Can't carry you much longer

413
00:32:57,464 --> 00:32:58,623
趁这只怪兽定住了
Since that monster isn't here...

414
00:32:58,831 --> 00:33:01,558
我们再来试试怎么解好不好？
Let's try to lift the spell

415
00:33:03,931 --> 00:33:05,760
是不是跟这个咒有关？
Does it have anything to do with this amulet?

416
00:33:05,965 --> 00:33:08,954
是？跟着怎么样？
Yes?! What then?

417
00:33:11,865 --> 00:33:14,626
跟着就指着我，指着我就可以解咒了
Point at me. Point at me and the curse will be lifted

418
00:33:14,831 --> 00:33:16,626
指呀！
Point!

419
00:33:17,564 --> 00:33:21,758
怎么解呢？…怎么解呀？
How do I undo the spell?

420
00:33:24,931 --> 00:33:27,089
问你也是白问，自己想好了
No good asking you! I must figure it out for myself

421
00:33:41,798 --> 00:33:44,923
哗！…定！
Freeze!

422
00:33:50,931 --> 00:33:55,659
不许动！…动呀，动呀！
Don't move! Move! Move!

423
00:33:55,865 --> 00:33:57,455
不许动！…
Don't move!

424
00:33:59,831 --> 00:34:00,931
我真不明白
Why does he

425
00:34:00,931 --> 00:34:01,897
为什么他一会儿就没事了
"unfreeze" so quickly

426
00:34:02,097 --> 00:34:04,393
而你就这么久都一点不动呢？
but you haven't moved for so long?

427
00:34:04,831 --> 00:34:10,593
难道…我指着这符，就在想
Do you mean... I pointed to this amulet...

428
00:34:10,898 --> 00:34:13,090
然后就问你怎么解…
Then I asked you how to lift the spell...

429
00:34:13,631 --> 00:34:16,722
他就动了，定！
And he moved! Freeze!

430
00:35:23,964 --> 00:35:25,760
我顶着，快走呀！
I'll take care of it Get out of here fast!

431
00:35:27,130 --> 00:35:28,596
终于也解了
Finally lifted the spell!

432
00:35:30,030 --> 00:35:31,189
走呀！
Get out of here!

433
00:35:31,731 --> 00:35:33,026
风雷地动令，开路！
Abracadabra! Open up a way out!

434
00:35:36,831 --> 00:35:38,797
风雷地动令，开路！
Abracadabra! Open up a way out!

435
00:35:42,798 --> 00:35:44,491
先走开，我来对付它
Out of the way! I'll take care of it!

436
00:35:54,531 --> 00:35:55,861
叭呢叭呢吽！
Abracadabra!

437
00:36:00,930 --> 00:36:02,453
风火雷电鬼！
Hocus pocus!

438
00:36:06,764 --> 00:36:08,059
叭呢叭呢吽！
Abracadabra!

439
00:36:11,498 --> 00:36:12,725
风火雷电鬼！
Hocus pocus!

440
00:36:23,731 --> 00:36:28,060
天地法灵，逐鬼驱魔令
I order all ghosts to be expelled!

441
00:36:39,164 --> 00:36:40,993
好厉害，不怕我的符咒
Wow! It doesn't fear my incantations!

442
00:36:46,897 --> 00:36:48,022
看招！
Take this!

443
00:36:53,830 --> 00:36:54,921
还动！
It's still moving!

444
00:36:56,698 --> 00:37:06,529
逐鬼驱魔令！风雷地动令！
I order all ghosts to be expelled! Hocus pocus!

445
00:37:14,964 --> 00:37:16,692
这样还让它的上半身走脱了
Even when it's chopped up he can still run away!

446
00:37:16,897 --> 00:37:18,386
它可能随时会回来的
It could still come back at any time

447
00:37:18,598 --> 00:37:20,530
前辈，你快点离开这里，我去追他
Elder, get out of here I'll pursue it!

448
00:37:20,731 --> 00:37:21,897
你小心点啊！
Be careful!

449
00:37:21,897 --> 00:37:23,022
遁地！
Earth, open up!

450
00:37:32,464 --> 00:37:33,986
天亮了！
Dawn is breaking

451
00:37:37,997 --> 00:37:40,054
急急如律令！定！
Heebie-jeebie! Freeze!

452
00:37:45,930 --> 00:37:47,191
定！
Freeze!

453
00:37:50,897 --> 00:37:51,863
遁地！
Earth, open up!

454
00:37:58,930 --> 00:38:00,021
想走！
Want to leave!

455
00:38:00,964 --> 00:38:01,987
好厉害！
Wow!

456
00:38:04,531 --> 00:38:05,791
法术都来不及用
My magical powers are no good at all

457
00:38:12,130 --> 00:38:13,391
遁地！
Earth, open up!

458
00:38:13,598 --> 00:38:14,756
是个术士？
A magician?!

459
00:38:15,097 --> 00:38:16,563
看镖！
Take this!

460
00:38:27,830 --> 00:38:30,194
喂，停呀，停呀！
Hey! Stop! Stop!

461
00:38:30,797 --> 00:38:32,956
你傻的，叫你停都不停
Are you stupid? I told you to stop!

462
00:38:33,431 --> 00:38:35,420
你我素不相识，为什么要拼命呢？
We don't even know each other Why are we fighting?

463
00:38:36,564 --> 00:38:38,825
我们的法术是用来对付妖魔鬼怪的
I learned magic to deal with evil spirits

464
00:38:39,030 --> 00:38:41,757
你再不停手，我就用法术定了你
If you don't stop, I'll use my magic to "freeze" you

465
00:38:42,830 --> 00:38:45,456
你是哪路人马，挡我的去路？
Why are you blocking my way?

466
00:38:45,864 --> 00:38:46,930
我在下面捉鬼
I was just taking a rest after battling some ghosts

467
00:38:46,930 --> 00:38:48,624
上来透透气这还说我挡路？
and you say I'm blocking your way

468
00:38:48,830 --> 00:38:50,728
天黑了那只妖怪走出来，你们就麻烦
When that monster makes a run for it tonight, you'll be in deep trouble

469
00:38:50,930 --> 00:38:51,555
兄弟！
Brother!

470
00:38:51,763 --> 00:38:52,888
叫我法师
Call me Master

471
00:38:53,097 --> 00:38:53,960
法师身手不凡
Master, your skill is extraordinary

472
00:38:54,164 --> 00:38:55,630
如果肯为朝廷效力
If you worked for the imperial court

473
00:38:55,830 --> 00:38:58,023
前途一定无可限量
your future would be boundless

474
00:38:58,231 --> 00:39:00,864
叫我法师，就知道我是出家人
You know that I'm a Taoist monk

475
00:39:00,864 --> 00:39:02,796
你们凡人喜欢升官发财
Seeking wealth and position is

476
00:39:02,997 --> 00:39:04,588
我要四大皆空
for the likes of you mere mortals

477
00:39:04,797 --> 00:39:08,957
我不跟你们一般见识，遁地！
I don't want to end up like you... Earth, open up!

478
00:39:11,864 --> 00:39:13,023
真是年少有为
Well done, young man!

479
00:39:13,231 --> 00:39:14,390
报告千户
Hu, our hourses' hoofs-are rigid

480
00:39:14,598 --> 00:39:17,393
我们的马匹都四蹄直伸，打也不动
They won't move!

481
00:39:22,531 --> 00:39:24,156
一定是那个术士作的法术
It must be that monk's magic at work!

482
00:39:24,531 --> 00:39:26,655
他说天黑之后有妖怪，大家小心
He said there are evil spirits Be careful!

483
00:39:26,864 --> 00:39:27,887
是！
Yes!

484
00:39:40,797 --> 00:39:42,161
傅大人！
Lord Fu!

485
00:39:42,930 --> 00:39:44,089
朝廷里的恩怨
There's nothing I can do about

486
00:39:44,464 --> 00:39:46,589
不是我一介武夫所能干预
squabbles in the imperial court

487
00:39:46,797 --> 00:39:49,854
通常是非都是真相不白
It's hard to tell right from wrong

488
00:39:50,130 --> 00:39:51,720
我只是奉命行事
I'm just following orders

489
00:39:51,930 --> 00:39:53,828
不过你可以放心
But don't worry

490
00:39:54,830 --> 00:39:57,126
我一定保你一路平安
I'll make sure your journey is safe

491
00:39:57,697 --> 00:39:58,830
回到京城之后
After we get to the capital

492
00:39:58,830 --> 00:40:02,922
皇上怎么处置你，就不是我的责任了
whatever the emperor does to you is not me responsibility

493
00:40:08,064 --> 00:40:09,155
上路！
Let's go!

494
00:40:20,663 --> 00:40:22,527
请问，哪里有东西吃呢？
Where can I get something to eat?

495
00:40:28,064 --> 00:40:29,864
老板，来一碗最便宜的
Please give me a bowl of your cheapest food

496
00:40:29,864 --> 00:40:31,091
什么？最便宜？
What? The cheapest?

497
00:40:31,464 --> 00:40:32,861
坐吧，坐吧！
Sit down!

498
00:40:32,997 --> 00:40:35,724
饿死了就不用花钱啦，穷鬼！
If you're starving don't waste your money

499
00:40:37,897 --> 00:40:39,557
给个脸我看看…
Show me your face

500
00:40:39,763 --> 00:40:40,820
走，走！
Go!

501
00:40:41,030 --> 00:40:42,757
站着！站着！
Stand up

502
00:40:43,564 --> 00:40:46,155
头抬高点，抬高点！
Don't lower your head

503
00:40:46,531 --> 00:40:47,189
走！
Go!

504
00:40:47,564 --> 00:40:48,859
走！
Go!

505
00:40:51,064 --> 00:40:52,030
别走呀！…
Don't run away!

506
00:40:52,231 --> 00:40:53,561
别走！
Don't move!

507
00:40:59,930 --> 00:41:01,157
和尚？
Monks?

508
00:41:02,930 --> 00:41:04,055
别走呀！
Don't move!

509
00:41:04,897 --> 00:41:06,523
站着！
Stand still!

510
00:41:17,663 --> 00:41:18,459
走开！
Out of the way!

511
00:41:18,663 --> 00:41:20,493
滚开呀！…
Get out of the way!

512
00:41:38,730 --> 00:41:40,628
这是什么法术呀？
What kind of magic is this?

513
00:42:03,231 --> 00:42:10,864
是青风他们…等等呀！
It's Windy... Wait!

514
00:42:10,864 --> 00:42:12,057
回来呀！
Come back!

515
00:42:12,864 --> 00:42:14,091
喂！
Hey!

516
00:42:14,797 --> 00:42:15,922
官兵昨晚避过十里亭
The soldiers never come to Ten Mile Pavilion last night

517
00:42:16,130 --> 00:42:17,925
快点回正气山庄埋伏
Rush back to Righteous Villa and lie in ambush for them

518
00:42:19,563 --> 00:42:22,189
喂！喂！
Hey!

519
00:42:22,864 --> 00:42:24,796
回正气山庄？正气山庄有鬼呀
Back to Righteous Villa? It's haunted!

520
00:42:26,197 --> 00:42:28,095
回来呀！
Come back!

521
00:42:34,964 --> 00:42:38,760
前辈！前辈！
Elder! Elder!

522
00:42:39,497 --> 00:42:40,827
不知道前辈走了没有
I wonder if Elder has already gone?

523
00:42:41,030 --> 00:42:41,864
大家到处找一找
Better search for him

524
00:42:41,864 --> 00:42:43,659
是！
Yes!

525
00:42:46,030 --> 00:42:48,825
你猜官兵押着爹会不会已经过了这里
Do you think father's transport has already passed by here?

526
00:42:49,030 --> 00:42:52,518
不会，照估计他们要天黑之后才会到
No. They're not supposed to reach here until after dark

527
00:42:52,730 --> 00:42:55,787
青风姑娘，里面好多地方都被毁烂了
Miss Windy, the villa has been ransacked

528
00:42:55,897 --> 00:42:57,886
一定是前辈消灭了我们留下的痕迹
I'm sure Elder did it to remove any traces of our presence

529
00:42:58,097 --> 00:42:59,393
大家装置机关，准备应战
Set everything up Prepare to attack

530
00:42:59,597 --> 00:42:59,995
是！
Yes!

531
00:43:00,197 --> 00:43:01,822
大家快点动手，去那边！
Hurry up! Over there!

532
00:43:51,864 --> 00:43:52,830
来者何人？
Who is it?

533
00:43:53,030 --> 00:43:54,757
来者何人？
Who is it?

534
00:43:55,563 --> 00:43:57,791
我是宁采臣，宁采臣？
I'm Ning Ning?

535
00:43:59,830 --> 00:44:01,557
原来是前辈
Oh, it's Elder!

536
00:44:01,763 --> 00:44:02,820
正气庄有鬼呀！
This villa is haunted

537
00:44:03,030 --> 00:44:03,961
有鬼？
Haunted?

538
00:44:04,164 --> 00:44:05,061
青风姑娘呢？
Where is Miss Windy?

539
00:44:05,430 --> 00:44:06,691
在里面！
Inside

540
00:44:07,864 --> 00:44:08,522
有鬼？
Ghosts?

541
00:44:08,730 --> 00:44:09,855
真的鬼？
Real ghosts?

542
00:44:32,797 --> 00:44:34,093
青风姑娘！
Miss Windy!

543
00:44:34,930 --> 00:44:36,089
衣服呢？
My clothes!

544
00:44:38,864 --> 00:44:40,125
青风姑娘！
Miss Windy!

545
00:44:41,830 --> 00:44:43,091
青风姑娘！
Miss Windy!

546
00:44:48,797 --> 00:44:50,456
前辈，他们说你来了！
Elder, they said you came

547
00:44:52,130 --> 00:44:52,925
月池姑娘！
Miss Moon!

548
00:44:53,130 --> 00:44:54,891
你是谁？
Who are you?

549
00:45:01,497 --> 00:45:03,895
前辈，我认得你的背影了
Oh, it's Elder I recognize your back

550
00:45:04,097 --> 00:45:06,154
前辈…
Elder...

551
00:45:07,497 --> 00:45:08,793
我…
I...

552
00:45:14,530 --> 00:45:16,894
原来你剃了胡子是这么…
With your beard shaved off you're so, so...

553
00:45:17,097 --> 00:45:18,824
是呀…
Yes

554
00:45:19,730 --> 00:45:20,864
我姐姐看到你这样子
When my sister sees you

555
00:45:20,864 --> 00:45:23,160
一定会替我高兴了
she'll be so happy for me

556
00:45:23,730 --> 00:45:24,627
高兴？
Happy?!

557
00:45:24,830 --> 00:45:26,853
对了，你进来的时候有没有见我姐姐
When you came in, did you see my sister?

558
00:45:26,964 --> 00:45:29,089
你姐姐？…没有，没有…
Your sister? No, No!

559
00:45:29,463 --> 00:45:34,021
姐姐！…姐姐！…姐姐！
Sister! Sister! Sister!

560
00:45:36,897 --> 00:45:38,090
你笑什么？
What are you grinning about?

561
00:45:38,463 --> 00:45:39,793
非礼勿视！
It is improper to look

562
00:45:44,497 --> 00:45:45,588
月池姑娘
Ms Moon

563
00:45:45,797 --> 00:45:47,387
有些东西你是不能看的
There are some things you shouldn't look at

564
00:45:47,597 --> 00:45:48,563
你没事吧！
You're all right!

565
00:45:48,763 --> 00:45:51,161
前辈剃了胡子，我真的认不出来了
I didn't recognize Elder with his beard shaved off

566
00:45:51,530 --> 00:45:53,723
是吗？那我也要去看看
Really? I must see for myself

567
00:45:53,930 --> 00:45:55,520
前辈，你有话就直说好了
Elder, if you have something to say, just say it

568
00:45:55,730 --> 00:45:57,830
你这样暗示，我好怕呀！
It scares me when you hint at things

569
00:45:57,830 --> 00:45:59,489
我好冷呀！
I'm cold

570
00:45:59,697 --> 00:46:02,095
你的脸这么热，还说冷？
Your face is so hot how can you be cold?

571
00:46:02,830 --> 00:46:04,930
前辈，我们这样会不会太快了？
Wouldn't this be faster?

572
00:46:04,930 --> 00:46:06,555
还不够快，再快点更好
Not fast enough Faster would be better

573
00:46:06,763 --> 00:46:09,729
还要再快点？那…好吧！
Faster?! OK

574
00:46:15,763 --> 00:46:16,195
前辈！
Elder...

575
00:46:16,563 --> 00:46:17,722
前辈！
Elder...

576
00:46:20,763 --> 00:46:22,695
前…辈说他好冷呀
Elder said he was cold

577
00:46:22,897 --> 00:46:24,056
冷？
Cold?

578
00:46:25,497 --> 00:46:27,486
前辈，你太辛苦了
Elder, you're overly exerting yourself

579
00:46:37,164 --> 00:46:39,891
请问两位，有没有见过青风姑娘呢？
Have you seen Miss Windy?

580
00:46:40,097 --> 00:46:42,120
没有，我也在找她
No, I'm looking for her, too

581
00:46:42,630 --> 00:46:43,994
她到哪里去了呢？
Where did she go?

582
00:46:47,497 --> 00:46:48,861
上面有声音，上去看看
There's noise coming from upstairs Let's go up for a look

583
00:47:07,930 --> 00:47:10,055
不要上去呀
Don't go up there

584
00:47:12,930 --> 00:47:14,896
奇怪！怎么没人？
Strange! Nobody up here

585
00:47:18,897 --> 00:47:20,487
可能在隔壁，过去看看
Maybe it's next door Let's go over and look

586
00:47:34,563 --> 00:47:35,790
你们乱哄哄的做什么？
What are you doing?

587
00:47:35,997 --> 00:47:38,622
宁采臣前辈回来找我…们呀
Sister, Elder came back to find me... us

588
00:47:38,797 --> 00:47:41,957
你看你们，衣衫不整的，成何体统呀
Why are your clothes so disheveled?

589
00:47:43,430 --> 00:47:45,453
以后不许你们这样失礼
Don't be so impolite in the future

590
00:47:50,797 --> 00:47:53,160
青风姑娘，这个山庄有鬼呀
Miss Windy, this villa is haunted

591
00:47:53,797 --> 00:47:55,558
我们以后还用得着扮鬼吗？
Do we still have to pretend to be ghosts?

592
00:47:55,763 --> 00:47:58,093
无论如何，我们一定要在这里等爹
No matter what, we must wait here for father

593
00:47:58,463 --> 00:48:00,156
是绝对不能离开的
We mustn't leave

594
00:48:01,497 --> 00:48:02,520
在这危急的时刻
In this moment of danger

595
00:48:02,730 --> 00:48:03,889
我们要挺起胸膛，不用畏惧
we must thrust out our chests and be fearless

596
00:48:04,097 --> 00:48:06,460
大家要肝胆相照，你们说对不对？
We must be utterly devoted to our cause

597
00:48:09,497 --> 00:48:10,861
挺起胸膛，不用畏惧
Elder, let's go in

598
00:48:11,064 --> 00:48:12,689
前辈！挺起胸膛？
Elder! Thrust out our chests

599
00:48:14,797 --> 00:48:17,456
你的衣服后面破了
Your clothes are torn in the back

600
00:48:39,230 --> 00:48:40,924
定心咒怎么写呢？
How do you write the "freeze" incantation?

601
00:48:47,597 --> 00:48:48,927
我不是偷看他
I didn't spy on him

602
00:48:49,129 --> 00:48:51,186
其实我根本不知道他在外面
I didn't even know he was outside

603
00:48:52,563 --> 00:48:54,188
小心呀，用绳子绑住你的心吧
Better tie your heart down

604
00:48:54,563 --> 00:48:56,392
再不绑住，快要飞出去了
Otherwise, it might fly away!

605
00:48:56,597 --> 00:48:57,927
绑得住我一定绑
If I could lie it down, I would!

606
00:49:13,163 --> 00:49:21,790
这样差不多了…定！
This is how you do it... Freeze!

607
00:49:25,230 --> 00:49:26,890
成功啦！
It works!

608
00:49:32,730 --> 00:49:33,930
这个就叫“定心咒 ”
This is the "freeze" incantation

609
00:49:33,930 --> 00:49:35,021
如果你看到妖怪
If you see that monster

610
00:49:35,230 --> 00:49:36,787
你就向着它叫“定 ”，就行了
do this and he'll freeze in his tracks

611
00:49:36,997 --> 00:49:37,830
是不是这样？
Like this?

612
00:49:37,830 --> 00:49:40,159
千万不要乱定，解咒就辛苦了
Don't do it haphazardly This spell is hard to reverse

613
00:49:40,530 --> 00:49:42,826
把手拿来！是！
Give me your hand. Yes!

614
00:49:54,196 --> 00:49:55,560
姐姐，什么声音？
Sister, what's that sound?

615
00:50:05,930 --> 00:50:09,384
在上面呀！青风！
It's coming form up there. Windy!

616
00:50:09,597 --> 00:50:13,552
青风，来，手给我
Windy, give me your hand

617
00:50:13,763 --> 00:50:15,092
前辈，你是不是应该叫我小倩？
Elder, shouldn't you be calling me Hsiao-tsing?

618
00:50:15,463 --> 00:50:17,656
小倩也好，青风也好，你用不着害羞
Whether I call you Hsiao-tsing or Windy there's no need to be bashful

619
00:50:17,864 --> 00:50:20,489
刚才的事，我会替你保守秘密的
I'll never reveal what happened just now

620
00:50:20,697 --> 00:50:22,897
我真替你紧张呀
I was really anxious on your behalf

621
00:50:22,897 --> 00:50:23,830
老实说
Actually, I kissed you because

622
00:50:23,830 --> 00:50:26,523
我亲你一下，是因为控制不了
I couldn't control myself

623
00:50:26,730 --> 00:50:28,059
幸亏你走得快
Fortunately you made a quick get-away

624
00:50:28,430 --> 00:50:30,555
否则被月池看见你没穿衣服
Otherwise, if Moon had seen you undressed and with me...

625
00:50:30,763 --> 00:50:33,558
就算是诸葛卧龙都解释不了啦
it would be hard to explain even if I were Elder Chu Kot

626
00:50:33,763 --> 00:50:35,260
来，手给我！
Give me your hand

627
00:50:35,900 --> 00:50:37,230
月池！
Moon?!

628
00:50:37,601 --> 00:50:41,055
月池，怎么你也在吗？
Moon, what are you doing here?

629
00:50:41,833 --> 00:50:42,731
我刚想找你
I was looking for you

630
00:50:42,933 --> 00:50:44,490
你们不用解释了
Don't bother explaining

631
00:50:44,701 --> 00:50:45,996
月池！
Moon!

632
00:50:46,601 --> 00:50:49,032
小倩，不是，青风，把手给我
No! Windy! Give me your hand

633
00:50:49,233 --> 00:50:52,960
小倩与你无缘，我早就许配了马家
We're not fated for each other I'm betrothed to Lord Ma's son

634
00:50:53,233 --> 00:50:54,631
你许配了人家了吗？
You're betrothed?

635
00:50:54,833 --> 00:50:55,765
我们不会有结果的
We weren't meant for each other

636
00:50:55,967 --> 00:50:58,899
你要找的应该是月池，不是我
You should be looking for Moon, not me

637
00:51:00,167 --> 00:51:04,566
青风，一个个来嘛，我两个都要找
Windy, one at a time I'm after both of you

638
00:51:12,933 --> 00:51:15,593
月池姑娘，天黑了，把手给我
Miss Moon, it's getting dark Give me your hand

639
00:51:16,000 --> 00:51:17,863
你去找姐姐吧！
Go to my sister instead

640
00:51:18,300 --> 00:51:20,857
我先找你再去找她，你快把手给我
I'll go to her next Quick, give me your hand

641
00:51:21,067 --> 00:51:22,590
前辈，你太花心了
Elder, aren't you the playboy!

642
00:51:22,800 --> 00:51:24,096
我们两个你只可以拣一个
You can only choose one of us

643
00:51:24,300 --> 00:51:26,198
我是不会跟姐姐争的
I'm not going to compete with my sister

644
00:51:27,534 --> 00:51:28,761
争什么，用不着争呀
No need to compete

645
00:51:28,967 --> 00:51:30,830
我写完你就会去写她
When I finish with you I'll go to her

646
00:51:50,033 --> 00:51:54,090
前辈，我有些心事要跟你讲
Elder, there is something I must tell you

647
00:51:54,900 --> 00:51:58,033
其实感情是一件好奇怪的事
Actually, love is a strange thing

648
00:51:58,033 --> 00:51:58,900
我一看到你
My heart beats wildly

649
00:51:58,900 --> 00:52:02,162
我的心就砰、砰、砰的跳
when I look at you

650
00:52:02,534 --> 00:52:08,558
我现在连望你一眼的勇气都没有
I don't even have the courage to glance at you

651
00:52:11,133 --> 00:52:15,088
我怕一望见你，我的心就跳了出来
I'm afraid that my heart would jump right out

652
00:52:18,567 --> 00:52:20,998
跟你在一起，你叫我去死我都愿意
I'd be willing to die if that's what you wanted

653
00:52:21,200 --> 00:52:23,098
永远不分开就好了
As long as I can be with you forever and ever part

654
00:52:28,733 --> 00:52:29,892
救命呀！…
Help!

655
00:52:30,100 --> 00:52:30,997
什么事？
What's that?

656
00:52:31,200 --> 00:52:33,496
天黑了，那只妖怪出来了
Hurry up! That monster is back

657
00:52:35,833 --> 00:52:36,992
前辈，你怎么变成这样呢？
Elder, what happened?

658
00:52:37,200 --> 00:52:37,995
进去看看！
Go inside and search

659
00:52:38,200 --> 00:52:39,223
好！
Yes!

660
00:52:40,667 --> 00:52:43,033
里边出现了一只好大好大
Inside there's a huge creature

661
00:52:43,033 --> 00:52:44,693
但不知道是什么东西呀
I don't know what it is

662
00:52:53,967 --> 00:52:55,228
镇定，大家用定心咒
Be calm! Use the "freeze" incantation Together: Freeze!

663
00:52:55,601 --> 00:52:58,226
定！
Freeze!

664
00:53:01,067 --> 00:53:02,055
真灵验呀！前辈，真灵验呀！
It really works!

665
00:53:02,267 --> 00:53:04,994
是呀，是很灵验
It sure does!

666
00:53:11,267 --> 00:53:13,732
真的定得一动也不动！
We froze it in its tracks

667
00:53:21,567 --> 00:53:22,624
大家跳上去！
Everybody, jump up there!

668
00:53:38,567 --> 00:53:39,725
机关？
The archery machine!

669
00:53:55,167 --> 00:53:56,723
小心呀，前辈！
Be careful, Elder!

670
00:54:14,200 --> 00:54:16,098
月池，你去救前辈，我去引开巨尸
Moon, go and rescue Elder I'll lure away that monster

671
00:54:16,300 --> 00:54:17,629
是！
OK

672
00:54:24,300 --> 00:54:24,993
放网！
Put out the net

673
00:54:25,200 --> 00:54:26,631
是！
Yes!

674
00:54:29,000 --> 00:54:30,227
你的手…
Your hand...

675
00:54:45,067 --> 00:54:46,294
我们撒离这里
Let's retreat from here

676
00:54:53,666 --> 00:54:54,098
去看看前面发生什么事
See what's going on up ahead

677
00:54:54,300 --> 00:54:55,493
是！
Yes!

678
00:54:58,200 --> 00:54:59,188
是官兵呀！
Soldiers!

679
00:54:59,566 --> 00:55:00,896
左千户，有埋伏呀！
Hu, they're set up an ambush

680
00:55:03,800 --> 00:55:05,164
青风，月池？
Windy, Moon?!

681
00:55:05,534 --> 00:55:06,261
是爹呀！
It's father!

682
00:55:06,633 --> 00:55:08,190
看清楚形势，引他们进庄
Lure the soldiers into villa

683
00:55:08,566 --> 00:55:09,657
没错，用机关对付他
Use the archery machine to mow them down!

684
00:55:09,866 --> 00:55:10,889
是！
Yes!

685
00:55:13,933 --> 00:55:15,058
想走？
Trying to get away?

686
00:55:17,033 --> 00:55:18,692
不好了，机关被巨尸破坏
The monster destroyed the archery machine!

687
00:55:18,900 --> 00:55:20,161
我们前后受敌
We're surrounded by our foes!

688
00:55:21,833 --> 00:55:23,527
别光站着，先放我出来
Let me out!

689
00:55:23,733 --> 00:55:25,131
对了…快放前辈出来
Right! Let Elder go!

690
00:55:25,334 --> 00:55:26,993
前辈，现在怎办呢？
Elder, what should we do now?

691
00:55:27,200 --> 00:55:28,097
我们先站到一旁去
We'll stay on the sidelines

692
00:55:28,300 --> 00:55:30,629
等巨尸来对付进来的高手吧！
When the enemy comes in, the monster will deal with them

693
00:55:40,200 --> 00:55:42,961
扮鬼都不像，快把面具脱下
Obviously a fake ghost Unmask it

694
00:55:48,267 --> 00:55:49,664
快出去救爹！是！
Let's rescue father! Yes!

695
00:56:00,267 --> 00:56:01,596
寡不敌众
You're hopelessly outnumbered

696
00:56:11,600 --> 00:56:12,861
好，我来救你
I'll save you!

697
00:56:15,334 --> 00:56:17,232
刀剑好锋利，很危险
Swords are too dangerous!

698
00:56:17,600 --> 00:56:19,032
不如用拳脚好吗？
Let's use our fists

699
00:56:33,766 --> 00:56:36,630
跟你说用拳脚，你看，现在搞成这样
I told you that swords are too dangerous!

700
00:56:58,233 --> 00:57:00,000
爹，爹！
Father

701
00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:01,795
你快走，不要理我
Get out of here Don't worry about me!

702
00:57:02,067 --> 00:57:03,657
那头向这边飞过来！
That giant corpse ran over here

703
00:57:05,633 --> 00:57:07,156
不要管我，快去救爹
Don't worry about me! Rescue father!

704
00:57:14,666 --> 00:57:16,132
原来妖怪在这里
The monster is here!

705
00:57:16,900 --> 00:57:18,957
叭呢叭呢吽，风火雷电霝
Abracadabra! Hocus pocus!

706
00:57:22,267 --> 00:57:23,960
风火雷电霝
Abracadabra! Hocus pocus!

707
00:57:27,967 --> 00:57:30,058
青风！青风！
Windy! Windy!

708
00:57:30,267 --> 00:57:31,562
中了妖毒？
Possessed by evil spirits?!

709
00:57:31,766 --> 00:57:32,561
姐姐…
Sister!

710
00:57:32,766 --> 00:57:33,255
青风，青风她怎么了？
What happened to Windy?

711
00:57:33,633 --> 00:57:34,258
她中了妖毒！
She's been possessed by evil spirits

712
00:57:34,633 --> 00:57:35,656
那怎么办？
What should we do?

713
00:57:35,866 --> 00:57:39,196
附近还有很多官兵，进去再说
Still a lot of soldiers around Better get inside

714
00:57:42,766 --> 00:57:44,027
别动！
Don't move!

715
00:57:44,700 --> 00:57:45,893
按着她，按着她！
Press down on her!

716
00:57:46,100 --> 00:57:47,963
姐姐！…
Sister!

717
00:57:48,167 --> 00:57:49,826
快想办法救姐姐
Think of a way to save my sister

718
00:57:50,033 --> 00:57:51,260
很辣手，她妖毒发作
She's possessed by the den

719
00:57:51,633 --> 00:57:53,622
很快就会变成刚才那只妖
She could turn into a giant monster at any moment

720
00:57:53,833 --> 00:57:55,197
你这奸臣，害得我姐姐变成这样
It's your fault, you traitor!

721
00:57:55,566 --> 00:57:56,964
我要杀了你！
I'll kill you!

722
00:57:57,167 --> 00:57:58,860
不要，他外面还有很多兵马
Wait! His troops are still out there

723
00:57:59,067 --> 00:58:01,794
留着他，可以用他来做人质
We must keep him as a hostage

724
00:58:03,700 --> 00:58:06,189
现形啦，她快要变尸妖了
She's turning into a corpse monster!

725
00:58:07,167 --> 00:58:08,224
姐姐…
Sister!

726
00:58:08,600 --> 00:58:09,657
最快的方法，就是立刻杀了她
We must kill her immediately

727
00:58:09,866 --> 00:58:10,627
那她就变不成了
Otherwise she'll turn into a monster

728
00:58:10,833 --> 00:58:12,765
不能杀，不能杀
You can't kill her!

729
00:58:12,967 --> 00:58:14,092
你到底是好人还是坏人？
Are you a good person or evil?

730
00:58:14,300 --> 00:58:15,900
有奸臣不杀，要杀我姐姐？
You won't kill Hu, but you'll kill my sister

731
00:58:15,900 --> 00:58:17,957
杀奸臣！
Kill Hu!

732
00:58:18,633 --> 00:58:20,496
这里死多少人都没用
No matter how many you kill here you still won't save the kingdom

733
00:58:20,733 --> 00:58:21,892
皇上身边小人太多
The emperor is surrounded by sycophants

734
00:58:22,100 --> 00:58:24,191
根本不明白民间疾苦
and has no idea of the suffering of his people

735
00:58:24,566 --> 00:58:27,000
你们还是拿我的人头去感动皇上
Take my head to the emperor Maybe it will move him

736
00:58:27,000 --> 00:58:29,023
好让皇上明白我们是用心良苦
He'll be convinced of

737
00:58:29,233 --> 00:58:30,130
忠心不二
our sincerity and loyalty

738
00:58:30,334 --> 00:58:33,000
不行！爹！你死了就群龙无首了
Father, if you die we'll have no one to lead us

739
00:58:33,000 --> 00:58:34,522
还是拿我的头去代替你吧！
Take my head instead

740
00:58:34,733 --> 00:58:37,029
不行，拿我们的人头去吧！
No! Take our heads

741
00:58:37,233 --> 00:58:39,698
混账，人头是不可以拿来拿去
Bastards! What good is it to cut off your heads?

742
00:58:39,900 --> 00:58:41,230
何人在此发号施令？
Who are you, ordering people about?!

743
00:58:41,600 --> 00:58:44,566
我就是通天博学士诸葛卧龙！
I am the learned and brilliant Elder Chu Kot

744
00:58:44,866 --> 00:58:47,298
通天博学士诸葛卧龙？
The learned and brilliant Elder Chu Kot!

745
00:58:52,600 --> 00:58:55,089
原来是诸葛先生，请指点迷津
Please guide us

746
00:58:55,300 --> 00:58:57,000
我指点就是全部人都不准死！
None of you are permitted to die

747
00:58:57,000 --> 00:58:57,967
何解呀！
Please explain!

748
00:58:57,967 --> 00:58:58,933
何解？
Explain?!

749
00:58:59,133 --> 00:59:00,928
人头落地，皇帝还是执迷不悟
Your severed heads will mean nothing to the emperor

750
00:59:01,133 --> 00:59:02,564
那不是很不值得吗？还要解？
You'll have died in vain Need I explain more?

751
00:59:02,766 --> 00:59:04,027
笨猪！
Stupid pigs!

752
00:59:05,067 --> 00:59:07,260
还有她没解决呀
What about her?

753
00:59:20,666 --> 00:59:21,723
青风！
Windy!

754
00:59:21,933 --> 00:59:25,093
这下不好了，驱魔跟元神出窍
To exorcise her, she needs a dose of "yang" energy

755
00:59:25,299 --> 00:59:26,197
我功力不够
I am not powerful enough

756
00:59:26,566 --> 00:59:27,191
现在要快点想办法
We better do something soon

757
00:59:27,566 --> 00:59:28,900
否则迟了就来不及了
or it will be too late

758
00:59:28,900 --> 00:59:29,957
还有什么办法呢？
What can we do?

759
00:59:30,167 --> 00:59:31,632
用灵符试试，不过我没把握
Try this magic charm It may or may not work

760
00:59:31,833 --> 00:59:32,265
也要试试
Try it

761
00:59:32,633 --> 00:59:33,963
快点拉青风姑娘下来，好！
Hurry up and pull Miss Windy down OK.

762
00:59:48,933 --> 00:59:50,263
逐鬼驱魔令
I order the evil spirits to be exorcised

763
01:00:05,333 --> 01:00:06,129
怎么会变成这样？
How did this happen?

764
01:00:06,333 --> 01:00:07,959
好难看啊！
Really ugly!

765
01:00:10,967 --> 01:00:11,898
我把它妖身迫出来了
I've forced the evil spirit from her

766
01:00:12,100 --> 01:00:14,691
现在快给些阳气她，她才有一线生机
If she gets a quick dose of "yang" energy, there will be a gleam of hope

767
01:00:14,900 --> 01:00:15,866
快点，快点上去呀
Hurry up

768
01:00:16,067 --> 01:00:17,124
那快点给
Hurry!

769
01:00:17,333 --> 01:00:19,697
我是修道的，定力不够，不能近女色
I'm a monk. I must not get too close to women

770
01:00:19,900 --> 01:00:21,832
她的样子虽然难看，你们不用怕
Don't be afraid of her ugliness

771
01:00:22,033 --> 01:00:22,967
怎么给呀？
How do we give her "yang" energy?

772
01:00:22,967 --> 01:00:24,024
当然是用口传气过去
With your mouth, of course

773
01:00:24,233 --> 01:00:25,199
用口？
Mouth?

774
01:00:25,566 --> 01:00:26,964
难道用你的耳朵吗？
What then. Your ears?

775
01:00:27,167 --> 01:00:28,689
那送我上去
Send me to her

776
01:00:28,900 --> 01:00:31,491
叭呢叭呢吽，风火雷电霝
Abracadabra! Hocus pocus!

777
01:01:26,533 --> 01:01:27,760
姐姐！
Sister!

778
01:01:35,900 --> 01:01:36,831
男人不怕…
A real man is afraid of nothing

779
01:01:37,033 --> 01:01:38,623
原来是你…
It's you!

780
01:02:03,733 --> 01:02:04,756
大人
Lord, a golden-robed priest

781
01:02:05,000 --> 01:02:07,795
外面有个金袍法师正向着正气庄走来
is on his way here

782
01:02:08,967 --> 01:02:10,865
金袍法师？
A golden-robed priest?

783
01:02:26,533 --> 01:02:30,625
大人，大人！把兵器放下！
Lord! Put your swords down!

784
01:02:33,566 --> 01:02:37,157
还不够气，继续！
Not enough! More!

785
01:02:39,000 --> 01:02:40,295
放下兵器！
Lower your swords!

786
01:02:40,833 --> 01:02:42,162
放下全部兵器
Put all your swords down!

787
01:02:47,633 --> 01:02:50,724
真是国之将亡，豺狼当道
There are evildoers behind every country's downfall

788
01:02:50,933 --> 01:02:53,865
好，你就拿我的人头去领功吧！
Take my head and collect your reward

789
01:03:01,766 --> 01:03:04,231
刚才我看见各位视死如归
The way that you look death calmly in the face

790
01:03:04,600 --> 01:03:06,725
才知道各位忠君爱国
proves that you are loyal to our country

791
01:03:08,166 --> 01:03:10,564
我们的政见虽然不同
Even though our political views are different

792
01:03:10,766 --> 01:03:13,755
但是，我很愿意助各位一臂之力
I'm still willing to help you

793
01:03:14,000 --> 01:03:14,988
外面的金袍法师
The golden-robed Taoist outside

794
01:03:15,199 --> 01:03:17,933
就是护国法丈“普渡慈航”
is the High Priest

795
01:03:17,933 --> 01:03:19,660
普渡慈航？
The High Priest?

796
01:03:19,866 --> 01:03:22,195
宫内所有的祭礼跟法事
All the rites and rituals in the palace...

797
01:03:22,566 --> 01:03:24,828
皇上都会先询问过他的意见
the emperor consults him for guidance

798
01:03:25,033 --> 01:03:28,521
如果他肯劝谏，那就沉冤得雪啦！
If he speaks on your behalf justice will triumph

799
01:03:29,099 --> 01:03:30,827
爹！
Father!

800
01:03:31,900 --> 01:03:33,025
傅大人
Lord Fu, if you trust me

801
01:03:34,033 --> 01:03:37,521
你若能相信我，让我出去见他
let me go to him

802
01:03:37,733 --> 01:03:39,858
好把事情说明
I'll explain the true situation

803
01:03:45,566 --> 01:03:47,088
爹，他会不会出卖你？
Father, he might betray you!

804
01:03:47,299 --> 01:03:50,129
不会，要杀他早就杀了我
He could have killed me had he wanted to

805
01:03:55,000 --> 01:03:56,863
还没醒过来？
Still not awake?!

806
01:03:58,666 --> 01:04:00,894
够了，你不用再传气过来
Enough! I'm going to puke

807
01:04:02,967 --> 01:04:05,660
前辈…
Elder!

808
01:04:09,600 --> 01:04:11,225
宁采臣！
Ning!

809
01:04:38,566 --> 01:04:40,862
左千户参见护国法丈
I am here to pay my respects to the high priest

810
01:04:41,266 --> 01:04:43,993
卑职查出钦犯傅天仇并非奸臣乱党
Lord Fu is not a traitor

811
01:04:44,199 --> 01:04:46,757
实在是忠义之士，并无叛国之心
He is a loyal subject, a patriot

812
01:04:46,967 --> 01:04:48,899
请法丈主持正义
I hope that you will uphold justice

813
01:04:49,633 --> 01:04:53,759
当今之世，太多人是非不分
There are many who cannot tell between good and evil

814
01:04:53,966 --> 01:04:55,956
不了解朝廷的苦处
They do not know the hardships of the imperial court

815
01:04:56,166 --> 01:04:59,132
本法丈今次出游，就是平息民怨
The purpose of my journey is to pacify the people

816
01:04:59,333 --> 01:05:02,925
好，就等本法丈替朝廷安排一下
I'll intercede at court

817
01:05:03,132 --> 01:05:04,689
这些忠臣义士吧
on behalf of these loyal subjects

818
01:05:04,900 --> 01:05:05,866
善哉，善哉！
Amen! Amen!

819
01:05:06,066 --> 01:05:07,726
谢法丈！
Thank you, High Priest!

820
01:05:30,066 --> 01:05:32,532
知秋大侠，你怎么啦？
How are you, Autumn?

821
01:05:35,900 --> 01:05:39,161
女色果然厉害，我要不是集中精神
Women are very tempting If I didn't exercise self-control...

822
01:05:39,533 --> 01:05:41,761
元神都差点被你弄散了
my energy would have been dissipated

823
01:05:45,833 --> 01:05:48,999
千户戾气太重，有损法丈祥和之气
Hu is treacherous and disrupts the High Priest's harmony

824
01:05:48,999 --> 01:05:50,488
请留步
Please stay here

825
01:06:15,733 --> 01:06:18,824
犯官礼部尚书傅天仇拜见法丈大人
The convict Lord Fu is here to see the High Priest

826
01:06:19,032 --> 01:06:20,794
拜见法丈大人
I pay my respect to the High Priest

827
01:06:20,999 --> 01:06:24,762
善哉！善哉！你们杀气太大
Amen! Amen! You have a murderous air about you

828
01:06:24,966 --> 01:06:28,729
还不快点放下屠刀，立地成佛
Put down your weapons

829
01:06:28,932 --> 01:06:32,023
下官身陷冤狱，但是心怀国事
I've been framed, but I am concerned about our nation

830
01:06:32,232 --> 01:06:35,966
素闻法丈慈悲，望助皇上普救世上
You are so merciful

831
01:06:35,966 --> 01:06:37,159
重振国运
Guide the emperor to save the nation

832
01:06:37,533 --> 01:06:40,727
浮世苍生，原是一场大劫
Life is chaotic

833
01:06:40,932 --> 01:06:44,989
虽知苦海无边，回头是岸
Mistakes can always be corrected

834
01:07:22,700 --> 01:07:24,927
我前生冤孽深重
In my former life I was evil

835
01:07:24,999 --> 01:07:30,863
今世有此报应，冤孽
so I must do good in this life

836
01:07:31,899 --> 01:07:35,559
法丈慈悲，法丈打救
Release my soul from purgatory

837
01:07:35,766 --> 01:07:40,221
法丈慈悲，法丈打救…
Release my soul from purgatory

838
01:07:51,932 --> 01:07:53,296
索命梵音？
Evil chanting?!

839
01:07:55,333 --> 01:07:56,923
不要上他的当
Don't be tricked!

840
01:07:57,799 --> 01:07:58,958
坐下！
Sit down!

841
01:08:01,166 --> 01:08:03,064
他假慈悲，不要听他的妖音呀
His mercy is false! Don't be tricked by his devilish voice!

842
01:08:04,966 --> 01:08:08,023
神兵火急，急急如律令，定！
Abracadabra! Freeze!

843
01:08:13,999 --> 01:08:15,590
逐鬼驱魔令
I order the evil spirits to be exorcised!

844
01:08:28,765 --> 01:08:34,027
南呒极乐世界，西方如来法驾到此
I am the absolute Buddha

845
01:08:34,999 --> 01:08:36,862
你们这些邪魔妖孽
What kind of evil spirit are you!

846
01:08:37,066 --> 01:08:40,555
在佛祖面前，还不赶快现形？
Even before Buddha you refuse to reveal your true appearance!

847
01:08:40,966 --> 01:08:43,694
邪魔妖孽？我现形就是这样了
The spirit of evil?! I am what I look like!

848
01:08:43,899 --> 01:08:45,990
我就不信你是如来佛祖，呸！
I don't believe you are Buddha!

849
01:08:46,199 --> 01:08:47,130
让我们过去看看，是真是假
Let's go over and see if you're real or false

850
01:08:47,533 --> 01:08:48,692
不要过去！
Don't

851
01:08:59,966 --> 01:09:03,796
叭呢叭呢吽！风火雷电霝！
Abracadabra! Hocus pocus!

852
01:09:21,799 --> 01:09:22,663
前辈！
Elder!

853
01:09:22,865 --> 01:09:24,525
左千户那个狗官出卖了我们
The bastard Hu betrayed us

854
01:09:24,732 --> 01:09:26,130
这里有我顶住，你们快走！
I'll take care of things here Leave quickly!

855
01:09:26,333 --> 01:09:30,595
叭呢叭呢吽，风火雷电霝，运转乾坤
Abracadabra! Hocus pocus! The universe revolves

856
01:09:36,899 --> 01:09:38,999
修道之人，心中有佛
May Buddha be in your heart

857
01:09:38,999 --> 01:09:42,124
明知道他是假的，我都克服不到
I knew he was false, but couldn't conquer him

858
01:09:42,966 --> 01:09:44,125
我输了！
I failed!

859
01:09:46,699 --> 01:09:48,665
有你们在，我的法术都使不出来
I can't perform my magic with you here

860
01:09:48,766 --> 01:09:51,426
我在后面开条地道，你们快点过去
I'll open a tunnel in the earth for you Hurry!

861
01:09:58,565 --> 01:09:59,553
知秋！
Autumn!

862
01:09:59,766 --> 01:10:02,096
快点，快点走！
Hurry up!

863
01:10:02,465 --> 01:10:03,761
我顶不住了！
I can't hold out

864
01:10:03,999 --> 01:10:05,521
走呀！
Hurry!

865
01:10:06,099 --> 01:10:10,327
叭呢叭呢吽，走呀！快点呀！
Abracadabra! Hurry!

866
01:10:10,699 --> 01:10:11,687
知秋！
Autumn!

867
01:10:18,732 --> 01:10:19,663
爹！
Father!

868
01:10:31,932 --> 01:10:35,092
就算走脱了，始终逃不出手掌
They've escaped for now but I'll get them in the end

869
01:10:35,465 --> 01:10:36,954
先把捉到那三个押回去
Guard the three we've captured!

870
01:10:37,333 --> 01:10:38,764
领法旨！
Yes!

871
01:10:46,632 --> 01:10:48,461
法丈，傅大人怎么啦？
What about Lord Fu?

872
01:10:48,666 --> 01:10:50,632
他们已经知错走了
They have admitted their errors They have departed

873
01:10:50,832 --> 01:10:53,298
世人应该知道天高地厚
People should acknowledge the immensity of the universe

874
01:10:53,499 --> 01:10:54,965
我刚才听到有打斗声
I just heard a fight going on

875
01:10:55,332 --> 01:10:58,298
哼！你耳根不净
Your ears aren't clean!

876
01:10:58,499 --> 01:11:00,965
记着，色即是空，空即是色
Vacate your mind to attain

877
01:11:01,332 --> 01:11:03,423
善哉善哉！
perfect peace of mind

878
01:12:02,732 --> 01:12:04,721
好冷呀！
I'm very cold

879
01:12:38,699 --> 01:12:42,426
小倩，小倩！
Hsiao-tsing!

880
01:12:49,599 --> 01:12:51,497
你不要离开我
Don't leave me!

881
01:13:04,499 --> 01:13:08,591
小倩…
Hsiao-tsing!

882
01:13:12,332 --> 01:13:14,525
小倩，你不要去投胎
Don't be reincarnated so soon

883
01:13:15,599 --> 01:13:17,895
现在做人好难呀
It's too hard to be mortal now

884
01:13:18,332 --> 01:13:20,628
你对小倩真是太好了
You're so good to Hsiao-tsing

885
01:13:20,699 --> 01:13:23,494
到了这个时候，还叫着小倩的名字
I never realized how much you missed her!

886
01:13:23,699 --> 01:13:26,722
我真想不到你这么挂念小倩
I never realized how much you missed her!

887
01:14:30,532 --> 01:14:32,998
十里平湖霜满天
Frost fills the sky over Ten Mile Lake

888
01:14:33,365 --> 01:14:36,661
寸寸青丝愁华年
Silken threads anxious of youth

889
01:14:38,399 --> 01:14:41,632
对月形单望相护
Looking at the moon and feeling lonely

890
01:14:41,632 --> 01:14:45,291
只羡鸳鸯不羡仙
Envious of lovers, not of immortality

891
01:14:45,866 --> 01:14:49,798
只羡鸳鸯不羡仙
Envious of lovers, not of immortality

892
01:14:58,899 --> 01:15:00,626
小倩！
Hsiao-tsing!

893
01:15:08,732 --> 01:15:10,561
小倩，你还坐着做什么？
Hsiao-tsing, what are you doing here?

894
01:15:10,866 --> 01:15:12,798
快躲起来，你是不能让阳光照射的
Hide! You can't let the sun shine on you!

895
01:15:12,999 --> 01:15:14,589
让阳光照射你就会魂飞魄散
If the sun shines on you your soul will be scattered

896
01:15:14,799 --> 01:15:17,594
那你就永远都投不了胎，转不了世啦
You would never be reincarnated!

897
01:15:18,432 --> 01:15:19,227
怎么你还坐着？
Why don't you listen to me?

898
01:15:19,432 --> 01:15:21,193
没听见我的话吗？小倩！
Hsiao-tsing!

899
01:15:26,699 --> 01:15:28,597
怎么是你呀？对不起！
Oh, it's you! I'm sorry

900
01:15:28,799 --> 01:15:30,560
我又搞错了
Once again I've made a mistake

901
01:15:32,332 --> 01:15:33,821
我错当作你是她了
I mistook you for she

902
01:15:38,032 --> 01:15:40,464
原来小倩是真有其人
So there really is someone named Hsiao-tsing!

903
01:15:40,666 --> 01:15:42,632
是不是画里的那个？
Is she the one in the painting?

904
01:15:43,232 --> 01:15:44,698
你是不是很挂念她？
Do you miss her very much?

905
01:15:45,699 --> 01:15:47,995
小倩的骨灰已经长埋黄土
She's already dead and buried

906
01:15:48,699 --> 01:15:50,688
我们永远见不到面了
We'll never meat again

907
01:15:53,832 --> 01:15:56,957
原来这样，你可以暂时当我是小倩
If you want, you can call me Hsiao-tsing for now

908
01:15:57,332 --> 01:15:58,798
暂时？
For now?

909
01:16:02,599 --> 01:16:06,929
我明白你的意思，你早就许配人了
I understand You're betrothed to another

910
01:16:08,465 --> 01:16:09,658
我认识小倩的时候
When I knew Hsiao-tsing

911
01:16:09,866 --> 01:16:12,627
她也是这样说，她许配了人
she was also betrothed to somebody else

912
01:16:12,899 --> 01:16:14,694
我是身不由己
It's beyond my control

913
01:16:16,499 --> 01:16:19,556
身不由己？小倩也是这样说
Hsiao-tsing said exactly the thing

914
01:16:26,732 --> 01:16:29,926
你跟小倩，一个是人，一个是鬼
You are mortal; she's a ghost

915
01:16:30,766 --> 01:16:32,698
但都没什么分别
But you're both exactly the same

916
01:16:36,699 --> 01:16:38,632
我们真的很像吗？
Are we very much alike?

917
01:16:38,632 --> 01:16:41,496
是很像，像才难搞
Too much so

918
01:16:41,699 --> 01:16:43,892
就因为像才给了我一个假希望
You gave me false hope

919
01:16:44,699 --> 01:16:47,563
不过，假希望总比没希望好
Anyway, false hope is better than none

920
01:16:50,766 --> 01:16:52,493
客、官！
Excuse me!

921
01:16:54,465 --> 01:16:57,192
客、官！两位请用茶
Here's your tea

922
01:16:57,532 --> 01:16:59,259
等一下就会送饭菜上来了
Your meal will be served presently

923
01:16:59,465 --> 01:17:00,987
两位请先随便休息一下
Please make yourselves at home

924
01:17:04,998 --> 01:17:07,556
这个人我见过，他是…
I've seen that man before He's...

925
01:17:08,399 --> 01:17:13,388
不能喝茶，有毒，这间是黑店
The tea is poisoned! This inn is run by thieves!

926
01:17:13,599 --> 01:17:14,326
真的？
Really!

927
01:17:14,532 --> 01:17:14,896
水烧了没有？
Is the water boiling?

928
01:17:15,265 --> 01:17:15,731
烧了！
Yes

929
01:17:15,931 --> 01:17:16,795
刀磨利没有？
The blade sharpened?

930
01:17:16,998 --> 01:17:17,692
磨利了
Nice and sharp

931
01:17:17,899 --> 01:17:18,762
磨利就快上呀
Everything's ready

932
01:17:18,965 --> 01:17:20,226
那小子马上下锅
Put the man in the cauldron immediately

933
01:17:20,432 --> 01:17:23,330
女的留着今晚暖被窝，天气冷呀！
Save the woman for tonight to warm our could beds

934
01:17:23,732 --> 01:17:25,561
杀！
Kill!

935
01:17:26,666 --> 01:17:30,257
剁呀…剁呀…
Slice them up good!

936
01:17:30,465 --> 01:17:34,557
剁呀，剁呀！
Right on!

937
01:17:35,732 --> 01:17:39,664
停手，停手，停手呀！
Stop!

938
01:17:42,265 --> 01:17:43,356
我有血有肉你都砍得下手
Watch where

939
01:17:43,565 --> 01:17:45,326
你还是人吗？
you're stabbing!

940
01:17:47,299 --> 01:17:49,561
窗门打开了，一定是从这儿逃走了
They escaped through the window

941
01:18:02,465 --> 01:18:04,590
这里很危险，这样逃不是办法
It's dangerous here This is no way to escape!

942
01:18:07,732 --> 01:18:09,254
你先跳上树去避一避
Better jump into the tree and hide

943
01:18:11,032 --> 01:18:13,328
我还没复完，没力气跟你一起上去
I still haven't recovered No energy to jump

944
01:18:15,599 --> 01:18:17,326
不用理我，逃得一个算一个
Don't worry about me. Run!

945
01:18:17,532 --> 01:18:18,828
不，我不会离开你的
No. I won't leave you

946
01:18:22,499 --> 01:18:24,294
这次我们真的走投无路了
This time there's no escape!

947
01:18:24,499 --> 01:18:25,930
真想不到我们会死在这里
I never thought we'd die here

948
01:18:26,299 --> 01:18:27,356
诸葛前辈，都是我们累了你啦
Elder, it's our fault for getting you involved

949
01:18:29,732 --> 01:18:31,357
我不是什么诸葛卧龙
I'm not Elder Chu Kot

950
01:18:31,599 --> 01:18:33,894
我只不过是读过几本书的穷书生
I'm just a poor scholar

951
01:18:34,666 --> 01:18:35,892
我不管你是谁
No matter who you are...

952
01:18:36,265 --> 01:18:37,526
能够跟自己喜欢的人死在一块
I feel fortunate to die

953
01:18:37,732 --> 01:18:39,493
我觉得很幸福
with the one I love

954
01:18:43,931 --> 01:18:46,329
我们以后再也不会分开了
We'll never be parted again

955
01:18:51,599 --> 01:18:55,554
以后再也不会分开，你搂着我！
We'll never be parted again Hold me!

956
01:18:58,732 --> 01:19:03,255
让我在外面，那些狼要吃的就先吃我
Let me be on the outside so that the wolf eats me first

957
01:19:04,632 --> 01:19:06,291
你真是太好了
You're wonderful

958
01:19:09,032 --> 01:19:10,692
你也是！
So are you

959
01:19:10,898 --> 01:19:12,694
永远都是这样就好了
If we could be like this forever it would be great

960
01:19:47,632 --> 01:19:51,689
兰…若…寺！
Orchid Temple!

961
01:19:51,898 --> 01:19:52,660
兰若寺！
Orchid Temple!

962
01:19:52,865 --> 01:19:54,422
什么兰若寺？
What's the Orchid Temple?

963
01:19:58,732 --> 01:19:59,720
怎么我忘了燕赤霞呢？
How could I have forgotten about Yin?

964
01:19:59,931 --> 01:20:01,591
他是谁？
Who is he?

965
01:20:01,798 --> 01:20:02,923
兰若寺有个长着大胡子的
The bearded man in the Orchid Temple

966
01:20:03,299 --> 01:20:04,322
他法力高强
A wizard in the occult

967
01:20:04,532 --> 01:20:06,623
找到了他，就可以对付普渡慈航了
If we find him, we can deal with the High Priest

968
01:20:19,599 --> 01:20:21,690
慈航法丈不是要回京城吗？
Isn't the High Priest returning to the capital city?

969
01:20:22,432 --> 01:20:23,988
为什么会回慈航大殿来了？
Why go to his palace?

970
01:20:24,632 --> 01:20:26,325
法丈连日讲经，有损真阴
He needs a tranquil place

971
01:20:26,532 --> 01:20:27,827
需要静养一晚
to meditate

972
01:20:33,865 --> 01:20:36,797
佛门圣地，难容俗人，千户留步！
Only holy people may enter this sacred place. Stay where you are

973
01:21:00,432 --> 01:21:02,227
天狗食月
This is the hour of the eclipse

974
01:21:06,599 --> 01:21:11,963
乱我丹鼎元气，我要现形了！
My body is changing against my wish

975
01:21:30,599 --> 01:21:33,497
为什么朝廷的文武百官全在这里呢？
Why are all the officials of the imperial court here?

976
01:21:41,599 --> 01:21:45,792
杨大人、江大人、李大人？
Lord Chiang! Lord Yang! Lord Lee!

977
01:21:46,731 --> 01:21:48,731
卑职本来奉各位大人之命
I was escorting Lord Fu

978
01:21:48,731 --> 01:21:49,629
押解钦犯回京
back to the capital...

979
01:21:49,831 --> 01:21:52,661
但是不能完成任务，请听卑职解释
But couldn't complete my mission Allow me to explain

980
01:21:55,365 --> 01:21:57,830
大人！…
Lord Chiang!

981
01:22:00,399 --> 01:22:01,558
怎么是个虚壳？
A hollow shell?

982
01:22:02,432 --> 01:22:05,659
杨大人，也是个虚壳？
Lord Yang is a hollow shell, too?

983
01:22:06,499 --> 01:22:07,396
这里是什么鬼地方？
What kind of a place is this?

984
01:22:07,599 --> 01:22:08,631
你们是什么妖魔鬼怪？
Are you demons?

985
01:22:08,631 --> 01:22:10,257
你们把这些名臣大将的血肉
What did you do with the flesh

986
01:22:10,499 --> 01:22:11,987
摆在什么地方？
and blood of these officials?

987
01:22:16,898 --> 01:22:19,659
你们跑到哪里去了？快点出来见我！
You demons, come out and face me!

988
01:22:24,698 --> 01:22:26,255
你为什么把朝廷大臣搞成这样？
Why did you do this to the imperial officials?

989
01:22:26,465 --> 01:22:28,431
你有什么居心？
What evil intentions do you harbor?

990
01:22:29,631 --> 01:22:31,495
全部都是虚壳？
Are they all hollow shells?!

991
01:22:32,499 --> 01:22:33,794
妖僧，我不管你是什么
I'm going to destroy

992
01:22:34,032 --> 01:22:35,622
今天我一定要消灭你
all of you evil monks

993
01:22:42,898 --> 01:22:45,421
奇怪，全跑到哪儿去了？
Strange, where have they hidden?

994
01:22:57,665 --> 01:23:01,722
知秋一叶？月池？傅大人？
Autumn? Moon? Lord Fu?

995
01:23:01,931 --> 01:23:04,692
傅大人，傅大人…
Lord Fu!

996
01:23:06,831 --> 01:23:09,389
怎么变成这样？其他人呢？
What happened? Where are the others?

997
01:23:10,432 --> 01:23:12,421
我信错了你，现在累死了这么多人
I was wrong to believe you! You've caused so much harm!

998
01:23:12,631 --> 01:23:13,427
你还有什么阴谋？
What other plots do you have up your sleeve?

999
01:23:13,631 --> 01:23:15,927
我们上当了，普渡慈航原来是只妖怪
We were tricked The High Priest is a demon!

1000
01:23:16,332 --> 01:23:18,491
朝廷好多大臣已经变成了行尸走肉
He turned many officials into walking corpses

1001
01:23:18,965 --> 01:23:20,692
我们快点赶到京城，禀告皇上
We must report this to the emperor

1002
01:23:20,898 --> 01:23:22,625
否则天下就万劫不复了！
Otherwise, the kingdom will be beyond redemption

1003
01:23:23,299 --> 01:23:24,598
原来祸根就是他
Oh, he's the one who instigated this calamity!

1004
01:23:24,598 --> 01:23:26,189
难怪朝纲大乱
No wonder the court is in upheaval

1005
01:23:26,432 --> 01:23:27,795
先去救了其他人再说，来！
We must hurry to rescue the others We can talk later

1006
01:23:32,665 --> 01:23:33,688
月池！
Moon!

1007
01:23:34,998 --> 01:23:36,554
爹！
Dad!

1008
01:23:41,698 --> 01:23:42,925
知秋！
Autumn!

1009
01:23:43,665 --> 01:23:45,698
狗官，朝廷有妖怪
There are demons in the court

1010
01:23:45,698 --> 01:23:46,823
那我不是要理国事了
so I must get involved in affairs of state

1011
01:23:47,032 --> 01:23:48,691
多一个人就多一分力量
Everyone must do his bit

1012
01:23:49,731 --> 01:23:50,890
快点走，现在是水深火热
Hurry! There's danger everywhere

1013
01:23:51,265 --> 01:23:52,560
过了这次大劫再说
Let's get past this hurdle first

1014
01:23:54,399 --> 01:23:55,422
妖僧法力高强
These demonic monks have great magical powers

1015
01:23:55,631 --> 01:23:57,620
趁他还没醒过来，我们快点离开这里
Once he's awake we won't be able to escape, so hurry!

1016
01:23:58,998 --> 01:24:00,657
知秋，快走，不要再打了
Autumn, get out of here! Don't fight anymore!

1017
01:24:02,865 --> 01:24:03,592
这里一片荒凉
This is a scene of desolation

1018
01:24:03,798 --> 01:24:05,424
大人，你骑我的马走吧！
Lord, ride my horse

1019
01:24:08,931 --> 01:24:09,555
索命梵音！
More chanting!

1020
01:24:09,765 --> 01:24:10,493
爹！
Father!

1021
01:24:10,698 --> 01:24:11,959
我用元神帮你集中精神
I'll use my powers to help you concentrate

1022
01:24:13,631 --> 01:24:15,654
回来呀，左千户，你打不过他的
Come back, Hu. You'll never beat him

1023
01:25:29,698 --> 01:25:32,926
放下屠刀，立地成佛
Put down your butchers' knives Bow before Buddha!

1024
01:25:36,698 --> 01:25:38,596
左千户，不要白白的牺牲呀！
Hu, don't sacrifice yourself in vain!

1025
01:25:40,531 --> 01:25:42,293
我错信了妖孽，杀害忠良
I mistakenly trusted these demons and slaughtered righteous officials

1026
01:25:42,498 --> 01:25:43,665
今天我要赎回我的罪行
To atone for my sins

1027
01:25:43,665 --> 01:25:45,256
我要跟他拼了
I'll fight him to the death

1028
01:25:47,399 --> 01:25:48,598
不要过去呀！
Don't!

1029
01:25:48,598 --> 01:25:51,224
我不入地狱，谁入地狱
I'm headed for hell anyway

1030
01:25:55,598 --> 01:25:56,621
左千户！
Hu!

1031
01:25:59,998 --> 01:26:02,731
大侠，风云变色，狂风挡路
Yin, why does the wind suddenly blow so violently?

1032
01:26:02,731 --> 01:26:04,629
现在难辨方向呀
It's hard to tell which direction is which

1033
01:26:05,464 --> 01:26:06,589
燕赤霞，怎么办呢？
Yin, what should we do?

1034
01:26:06,798 --> 01:26:08,355
一路上妖气冲天
Evil spirits pervade this road

1035
01:26:08,564 --> 01:26:10,224
千钧一发，不能停下来
Our lives hang by a slender thread

1036
01:26:10,431 --> 01:26:12,364
快点跟我继续赶路吧
We mustn't stop. Follow me!

1037
01:26:21,898 --> 01:26:24,296
天地无极，乾坤借法
Oh, boundless heaven and earth Help me!

1038
01:26:32,798 --> 01:26:48,731
大家跟我一起念，般若波罗密…
Recite the scriptures with me! Prajna paramita...

1039
01:26:48,731 --> 01:26:50,458
金刚法咒？
The Diamond Sutra incantation?

1040
01:26:50,965 --> 01:26:52,692
般若波罗密…
Prajna paramita...

1041
01:26:56,765 --> 01:27:00,198
无知小辈，敢在我面前放肆？
Ignoramus, behaving so boorishly in front of me!

1042
01:27:00,631 --> 01:27:02,257
般若波罗密！
Prajna paramite...

1043
01:27:04,698 --> 01:27:06,527
青风、宁采臣，避开！
Ning, Windy. Get out of the way!

1044
01:27:06,731 --> 01:27:08,822
天地无极，乾坤借法
Oh, boundless heaven and earth Help me!

1045
01:27:15,531 --> 01:27:20,987
南无极乐世界，西天如来在此
Buddha is present!

1046
01:27:25,731 --> 01:27:28,289
你真大胆，连如来佛也敢假冒？
If you dare to impersonate Buddha What would you not dare to do?

1047
01:27:28,498 --> 01:27:30,327
你这卑鄙妖怪，再继续扮下去
You think you can hoodwink the people forever?

1048
01:27:30,531 --> 01:27:32,463
连自己都信以为是真的
You think you can hoodwink the people forever?

1049
01:27:32,631 --> 01:27:33,790
你怎么扮都没用
I'm going to let everyone know

1050
01:27:33,998 --> 01:27:35,930
我要把你的假面目公诸于世
what you really are!

1051
01:27:36,299 --> 01:27:38,924
世人都喜欢偶像崇拜
The masses love to worship their idols

1052
01:27:39,298 --> 01:27:42,288
为什么你们要跟世人作对呢？
Why set yourself against the people?

1053
01:27:42,498 --> 01:27:43,987
我呸！就因为世人无知
It's their ignorance

1054
01:27:44,364 --> 01:27:45,698
才会被你乘虚而入
that has allowed you to succeed

1055
01:27:45,698 --> 01:27:47,288
就是要崇拜也不会崇拜你这些妖怪
I'll never let them worship demons like you

1056
01:27:47,498 --> 01:27:48,731
你别想骗人了
You'll never deceive the people again!

1057
01:27:48,731 --> 01:27:52,731
佛法无边，不依我的明灯指示
If you refuse to follow my shining beacon...

1058
01:27:52,731 --> 01:27:54,993
只有死路一条
you will be destroyed!

1059
01:27:55,564 --> 01:28:00,724
放屁，龙啸九天，万剑归宗
What crap! Look out!

1060
01:28:06,498 --> 01:28:08,555
皓天正气，日月齐光
Justice for all!

1061
01:28:16,765 --> 01:28:18,390
剑归无极
Swords are part of the infinite!

1062
01:28:25,531 --> 01:28:26,792
她的假身被我毁了
We've only destroyed the false outer body

1063
01:28:26,998 --> 01:28:27,929
随时会再来进攻
He can come back and attack us at any time

1064
01:28:28,298 --> 01:28:29,821
大家不要离开这个剑圈，念经！
We must use our swords to fight back!

1065
01:28:30,032 --> 01:28:32,665
道友，我来自我介绍，我是昆仑派…
Let me introduce myself I'm from the Kunlun sect...

1066
01:28:32,665 --> 01:28:34,255
这个时候还什么昆仑派呢
At a time like this, let's not separate into sects

1067
01:28:34,464 --> 01:28:36,623
大家要同仇敌盖，对付那只老妖怪
We're all fighting the same enemy Destroy this demon!

1068
01:28:36,831 --> 01:28:37,728
念经！
Chant with me!

1069
01:28:37,931 --> 01:28:53,991
般若波罗密…
Prajna paramita...

1070
01:28:55,564 --> 01:29:12,193
般若波罗密…
Prajna paramita...

1071
01:29:13,698 --> 01:29:15,459
老妖潜到地下去，破了我的剑圈
The old demon has stolen into the earth and broken through our ring of swords

1072
01:29:15,665 --> 01:29:16,926
大侠，那我们该怎么办呢？
What should we do?

1073
01:29:17,298 --> 01:29:18,525
你看！
Watch!

1074
01:29:20,865 --> 01:29:22,228
他是什么妖精呀？
What kind of demon?

1075
01:29:22,431 --> 01:29:23,658
跟我来！
Come with me!

1076
01:29:30,464 --> 01:29:31,862
大家拉着我，跟我飞上去
Hold on to me as I fly

1077
01:29:34,398 --> 01:29:35,694
宁采臣！
Ning!

1078
01:29:36,264 --> 01:29:37,628
你拉掉了我的衣袖呀
You pulled my sleeve off

1079
01:29:43,965 --> 01:29:45,658
你们又回来做什么？
What are you coming back for?

1080
01:29:47,598 --> 01:29:49,427
怎么又不见了？
What happened?

1081
01:29:49,631 --> 01:29:49,892
是不是走了？
Gone?

1082
01:29:50,298 --> 01:29:51,662
别吵！
Keep quiet!

1083
01:29:56,598 --> 01:29:59,655
小心，妖精现形了
Be careful The demon has changed its appearance

1084
01:30:08,298 --> 01:30:09,457
好大只呀！
It's huge!

1085
01:30:14,264 --> 01:30:15,457
小心呀！
Be careful!

1086
01:30:23,631 --> 01:30:26,426
月池，看着你爹，我去帮燕赤霞
Moon, look after your father I'll help Yin

1087
01:30:26,598 --> 01:30:28,564
知秋，小心呀！
Autumn, be careful!

1088
01:30:29,231 --> 01:30:30,254
原来是只千年蜈蚣
The demon's actually a giant centipede!

1089
01:30:30,464 --> 01:30:33,259
百足之虫，想变成龙？我呸！
That worm can never be a dragon

1090
01:30:33,064 --> 01:30:34,325
前辈！
Elder!

1091
01:30:41,164 --> 01:30:42,460
前辈！
Elder!

1092
01:30:43,531 --> 01:30:44,326
我出道以来
I've never had to deal with

1093
01:30:44,531 --> 01:30:46,121
从没对付过这么大的妖怪
such a giant creature

1094
01:30:46,198 --> 01:30:47,129
现在怎办？
What should we do now?

1095
01:30:47,331 --> 01:30:49,194
大又怎么样？剌他的天灵盖
Pierce the crown of its head

1096
01:30:59,000 --> 01:31:00,556
宁采臣！
Ning!

1097
01:31:03,766 --> 01:31:05,164
宁采臣！
Ning!

1098
01:31:11,000 --> 01:31:11,931
青风！
Windy!

1099
01:31:20,033 --> 01:31:22,555
龙啸九天，驭剑飞行
The flying sword!

1100
01:32:03,933 --> 01:32:05,058
般若波罗密！
Prajna paramite!

1101
01:32:08,266 --> 01:32:09,856
神剑伏妖
Exorcise the demons!

1102
01:32:13,933 --> 01:32:16,558
天地无极，乾坤借法
Oh, boundless heaven and earth Help me!

1103
01:32:25,566 --> 01:32:26,032
前辈！
Elder!

1104
01:32:26,233 --> 01:32:27,324
知秋！
Autumn!

1105
01:32:29,300 --> 01:32:31,066
孤掌难鸣，让我们双剑合壁
Two heads are better than one

1106
01:32:31,066 --> 01:32:33,531
叭呢叭呢吽，风火雷电霝
Abracadabra. Hocus pocus

1107
01:32:40,733 --> 01:32:42,596
风火雷电霝
Hocus pocus

1108
01:33:15,599 --> 01:33:18,394
唉，我躲在兰若寺这么久
I've been in the Orchid Temple for so long...

1109
01:33:18,599 --> 01:33:19,394
不知道人世间
I didn't know the world

1110
01:33:19,599 --> 01:33:21,758
现在变成魔、妖、神、鬼跟人
was so full of devils and demons

1111
01:33:21,966 --> 01:33:23,522
都混淆不清
It's hard to separate the living from the deed

1112
01:33:23,733 --> 01:33:25,858
搞得天下大乱
The world is in chaos

1113
01:33:26,433 --> 01:33:27,729
幸亏你躲在兰若寺
It's a good thing you hid in the Orchid Temple

1114
01:33:27,966 --> 01:33:30,523
否则我不知道该到那儿去找你
Otherwise I might never have found you

1115
01:33:30,933 --> 01:33:32,364
既然是同道中人
We share the same ideals...

1116
01:33:32,566 --> 01:33:34,532
不若我们大家浪迹天涯，替天行道
We should roam this world together and fight for justice

1117
01:33:34,766 --> 01:33:35,925
一起结伴同行好了
We should work together

1118
01:33:36,132 --> 01:33:37,530
你在说什么？
What are you saying?

1119
01:33:37,733 --> 01:33:39,665
我这个人向来是独来独往
I've always led a solitary existence

1120
01:33:39,866 --> 01:33:40,797
上次为了救小倩
Last time, I almost died

1121
01:33:40,866 --> 01:33:42,733
跟他一起，差点脱不了身
trying to help you save Hsiao-tsing

1122
01:33:42,733 --> 01:33:44,460
这次对付妖怪，跟你合作
This time, I've helped you battle the demons...

1123
01:33:44,666 --> 01:33:45,563
差点送了命
and almost lost my life

1124
01:33:45,766 --> 01:33:46,993
还是各自修行吧
It's better if we go our own ways

1125
01:33:47,366 --> 01:33:50,457
到你有难之时，我再来打救你好了
When you need my help I'll return and save you

1126
01:33:59,499 --> 01:34:00,760
小心呀，知秋！
Be careful, Autumn!

1127
01:34:03,599 --> 01:34:05,690
妖怪还没死呀
The demon still isn't dead

1128
01:34:05,866 --> 01:34:07,729
知秋！
Autumn!

1129
01:34:08,065 --> 01:34:10,623
我这下真是有难，你不救我不行了
I really need your help this time or I'm finished

1130
01:34:11,599 --> 01:34:13,428
真是好的不来丑的来
We must be jinxed!

1131
01:34:13,766 --> 01:34:15,425
我顶着，你快爬出来
I'll take care of things! Quickly, craw!

1132
01:34:15,633 --> 01:34:16,758
不行呀！
No good

1133
01:34:18,533 --> 01:34:19,499
知秋！
Autumn!

1134
01:34:23,966 --> 01:34:24,833
知秋！
Autumn!

1135
01:34:24,833 --> 01:34:25,799
那只蜈蚣飞过来了
That centipede flew over!

1136
01:34:26,032 --> 01:34:27,623
燕赤霞跟知秋怎么了？
What about Autumn and Yin?

1137
01:34:28,132 --> 01:34:30,758
我们被锁着，要想办法逃出去呀
We're locked in. We must think of a way to escape

1138
01:34:31,566 --> 01:34:35,089
你说得对，跟我一起你是太吃亏了
You're right! I've really caused you here

1139
01:34:40,499 --> 01:34:43,766
我们肉身被困，要元神出窍才有得救
Our bodies are restrained. We can be saved only if our souls can escape

1140
01:34:43,766 --> 01:34:45,095
元神出窍？
Souls?

1141
01:34:45,466 --> 01:34:46,727
我怕我功力不够
Will we have enough energy

1142
01:34:46,933 --> 01:34:49,490
出了窍回不了肉身呀
to later let the sols back in?

1143
01:34:49,733 --> 01:34:50,994
这是唯一的生路
This is the only way!

1144
01:34:51,366 --> 01:34:53,764
意守玄关，跟我念法咒
Chant along with me

1145
01:34:57,366 --> 01:34:59,730
无名无相，不虚不实
The spirit of Buddha conquers all!

1146
01:34:59,933 --> 01:35:03,387
无名无相，不虚不实
The spirit of Buddha conquers all!

1147
01:35:03,733 --> 01:35:07,733
金身不灭，元神出窍
Goodness is indestructible

1148
01:35:07,733 --> 01:35:12,131
金身不灭，元神出窍
Goodness is indestructible

1149
01:35:18,966 --> 01:35:20,766
般若波罗密，叭呢叭咪吽
Prajna paramite. Abracadabra!

1150
01:35:20,766 --> 01:35:22,925
叭呢叭咪吽，风火雷电霝
Abracadatra! Hocus pocus!

1151
01:35:24,866 --> 01:35:28,093
天地无极，风、火…
Oh, boundless heaven and earth Help me!

1152
01:35:55,166 --> 01:35:56,792
知秋！
Autumn!

1153
01:36:01,900 --> 01:36:03,798
大胡子！知秋！
Yin!

1154
01:36:04,499 --> 01:36:05,726
燕赤霞！
Yin!

1155
01:36:05,932 --> 01:36:07,762
回窍！
Soul, return!

1156
01:36:11,666 --> 01:36:12,757
回窍！
Soul, return!

1157
01:36:13,800 --> 01:36:15,322
我回不到窍呀！
My soul can't return to my body!

1158
01:36:15,900 --> 01:36:17,889
知秋，快点捉住元神
Autumn, catch the soul!

1159
01:36:18,099 --> 01:36:20,065
知秋！
Autumn!

1160
01:36:23,833 --> 01:36:26,424
他定力不够，回不到窍，我来帮他…
His power isn't strong enough I'll help him

1161
01:36:26,633 --> 01:36:28,758
般若波罗密…
Prajna paramite...

1162
01:36:29,833 --> 01:36:31,389
我捉不住他
I can't catch it

1163
01:36:31,965 --> 01:36:32,800
月池！
Moon!

1164
01:36:32,800 --> 01:36:34,356
知秋！
Autumn!

1165
01:36:44,833 --> 01:36:46,628
太迟了！
Too late!

1166
01:36:54,833 --> 01:36:56,662
知秋！
Autumn!

1167
01:38:20,865 --> 01:38:21,695
外面什么声音？这么热闹
What's all the hubbub outside?

1168
01:38:21,899 --> 01:38:23,956
什么声音？没有呀！
What hubbub? I don't hear anything!

1169
01:38:42,733 --> 01:38:45,460
哪一户人家闺女出阁，这么大的金猪
Who's getting married? Such a large golden pig!

1170
01:38:46,733 --> 01:38:49,665
这金猪是皇帝赐给傅天仇的
It's a gift to Lord Fu from the emperor

1171
01:38:50,765 --> 01:38:52,890
因为他揭发了奸臣妖孽
Since he exposed the traitors in the imperial court

1172
01:38:53,099 --> 01:38:54,531
替朝廷立了大功
he performed a great service for the emperor

1173
01:38:54,733 --> 01:38:57,789
所以特别赐只金猪给傅家送女过门
It's a wedding gift for Lord Fu's daughter

1174
01:39:00,765 --> 01:39:02,061
月池！
Moon!

1175
01:39:03,399 --> 01:39:05,558
月池，月池呀！
Moon!

1176
01:39:05,865 --> 01:39:07,763
宁采臣！
Ning!

1177
01:39:13,999 --> 01:39:15,760
是不是青风她…
Is Windy getting...

1178
01:39:15,965 --> 01:39:17,363
姐姐已经过门了
Sister is already married

1179
01:39:17,566 --> 01:39:19,861
你以后别让她难做了
Don't cause her any trouble

1180
01:39:21,466 --> 01:39:22,432
我要上路了
I'm about to start on a journey

1181
01:39:22,666 --> 01:39:26,462
你替我祝福他们同偕白首，永结同心
Give her my best wishes for a happy marriage

1182
01:39:28,965 --> 01:39:32,591
我会的，你保重呀！
I will. Take care of yourself

1183
01:39:43,399 --> 01:39:44,592
再见！
Adieu!

1184
01:39:59,799 --> 01:40:00,765
有时候人的希望
It's hard to differentiate

1185
01:40:00,765 --> 01:40:02,799
真真假假，实在分不出
between true and false hopes

1186
01:40:02,799 --> 01:40:06,357
我现在才明白你为什么要避开人间
Now I understand why you stay away from our mortal world

1187
01:40:06,599 --> 01:40:09,928
人是善忘的，好多事会随风而逝
Mortals are forgetful Good deeds fade like the wind

1188
01:40:10,132 --> 01:40:13,825
无论做过什么事，很快就会忘记了
No matter what you've done it's soon forgotten

1189
01:40:14,099 --> 01:40:15,997
这是好事还是坏事呢？
Is forgetting good or bad?

1190
01:40:16,366 --> 01:40:18,763
那我们应不应该再存有寄望呢？
Should we have hopes?

1191
01:40:26,599 --> 01:40:27,723
青风！
Windy?!

1192
01:40:31,999 --> 01:40:33,794
你说不存寄望的嘛
You said you'd cherish no hope!

1193
01:40:34,799 --> 01:40:37,527
姐姐，不要再犹豫啦，快过去吧！
Sister, don't hesitate! Go to him!

1194
01:40:44,965 --> 01:40:45,590
青风！
Windy?!

1195
01:40:45,832 --> 01:40:47,355
宁采臣！
Ning!

1196
01:40:47,799 --> 01:40:50,788
快点走吧，他们快追到了！
Let's go, hurry!

1197
01:40:51,799 --> 01:40:52,730
你回去吧！
You go back

1198
01:40:52,932 --> 01:40:54,398
再见！
Farewell!

1199
01:40:54,665 --> 01:40:55,722
保重！
Take care!

1200
01:40:56,533 --> 01:40:57,691
上路！
Let's go!


